(562, 101, 'Mailchimp Integration for Newsletter Subscribers', '<p><strong>Seamlessly grow your email list from your directory site</strong></p><p>The Mailchimp Integration for Newsletter Subscriptions tool streamlines the process of adding new subscribers to your Mailchimp list. By automating the transfer of newsletter signups, you eliminate manual exports and complex workarounds, making it easier than ever to build and engage your audience directly from your directory site.</p><hr><h2>What&rsquo;s Included in the Integration?</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>We integrate your Newsletter Signup Form with your Mailchimp Audience:</strong></p><ul><li>First Name (optional, if your form collects it)</li><li>Email Address (required)</li><li>Subscribers are added to your selected list instantly when they submit the form.</li></ul><hr><h2>Where Can Newsletter Signup Be Embedded?</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>You choose where to collect newsletter signups:</strong></p><ul><li>Home Page (e.g., footer or hero section)</li><li>Blog/Articles Page</li><li>Member Dashboard</li><li>No-Search Results Page</li><li>Thank You Pages</li><li>Any custom widget or modal form</li></ul><p>We&rsquo;ll help you place the form wherever it fits your funnel.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Here&rsquo;s how the Mailchimp integration for newsletter subscriptions functions behind the scenes:</strong></p><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> A visitor fills out your site&#39;s newsletter form (email + optional name).&nbsp;<img src=\"/images/solutions/a9341318c9451cdc85cdf3e295c2edeb34de0fa1.gif\" style=\"width: 752px; height: 421.12px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"e5d41632 a60d 4426 a994 5a856c0ab3b4\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> The data is instantly sent to your selected Mailchimp list.</p><p><br></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><ul><li>Grows your Mailchimp audience automatically</li><li>No manual exporting. No manual uploading. No headaches. No missed&nbsp;</li><li>Better segmentation and stronger marketing results</li></ul><hr><h2>Price Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $50</strong> &mdash; covers connecting your Brilliant Directories site to Mailchimp and automatically adding new newsletter subscribers to your selected Mailchimp audience.<br>If your setup requires tagging, segmentation, conditional logic, or advanced field mapping, then additional charges to be paid.<br><strong>Depending on your needs, we might suggest a different CRM solution that&rsquo;s a better fit.<br></strong></p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Mailchimp Tagging + Custom Fields</li><li>Member type or category</li><li>Page location (Blog, Dashboard, Join Page, etc.)</li><li>Checkbox or dropdown selections (e.g., &ldquo;Interested in&hellip;&rdquo;)</li><li>Ideal for segmentation and triggering automations in Mailchimp.</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests (if any)&nbsp;</strong>are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Want to grow your Mailchimp audience automatically?</h2><p>Click <strong>&quot;Order Now&quot;</strong> and we&rsquo;ll connect your Brilliant Directories site with Mailchimp &mdash; ensuring you never miss a subscriber again.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '9cd425371c36137e452f8f50e36193a5', 'solutions/mailchimp-integration-for-newsletter-subscribers', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Integrations,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 50.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Mailchimp News', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(563, 101, 'Custom Search Filters for Directory Websites', '<p><strong>Give Visitors the Power to Refine Results Instantly</strong></p><p>With <strong>Custom Search Filters</strong>, your directory moves beyond basic search and allows users to narrow down listings based on meaningful criteria &mdash; delivering relevant results instead of overwhelming them with noise.</p><hr><h2>Why Appropriate Filters Matter</h2><ul><li>Users don&rsquo;t want to browse &mdash; they want to find.</li><li>When search doesn&rsquo;t feel personalized, users leave.</li><li>When filters are tailored to how your directory works, users feel understood and stay longer.</li></ul><p><strong>Custom search filters</strong> tailored to your industry and niche remove irrelevant results, reduce friction, and turn your directory into a <strong>decision-making tool</strong> rather than just a browsing platform.</p><hr><h3>See It in Action (How the Design Will Appear)</h3><p>Custom filters appear directly on the search results page as dropdowns, checkboxes, sliders, or multi-select fields &mdash; styled to match your theme.</p><p>Users select what matters to them, and the listings update instantly.</p><p>[widget=video-searc-results-tools]</p><hr><h2>What It Helps for Everyone</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>They instantly get results that match their preferences.</li><li>No need to scroll through irrelevant listings.</li><li>Makes the directory feel intuitive and tailored to them.</li></ul><p>If a visitor or patient on your <strong>Dentists&rsquo; Directory</strong> is looking for a dentist in their zip or postal code, speaks Hebrew, loves dancing, prescribes chocolates, and sings for every patient &mdash; your directory should show just that.</p><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Their profiles surface when users filter using attributes they offer.</li><li>More visibility = more relevant leads.</li><li>Higher conversion because users searching with filters already have intent.</li></ul><p>If the Hebrew-speaking dentist who loves chocolates and music gets a patient looking for that combination &mdash; it&rsquo;s a perfect match made on your platform.</p><h3>For Directory Owners</h3><ul><li>Improves user experience and keeps visitors engaged.</li><li>Reduces bounce rate by showing only relevant results.</li><li>Increases the perceived value of your platform &mdash; members see the benefit of completing their profiles.</li></ul><hr><h3>Example (For Better Understanding)</h3><p>Imagine a directory that allows visitors to filter by:</p><ul><li>Gender</li><li>Languages spoken</li><li>Age range or availability</li><li>Interests, hobbies, or profession</li></ul><p>A visitor lands on your search results &rarr; applies filters &rarr; sees only perfectly matching listings.<br>They find what they want faster &mdash; and are more likely to convert into a lead.</p><hr><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $195</strong> &mdash; covers creating up to&nbsp;<strong>4 custom search filters</strong> (dropdowns, checkboxes, sliders, or multi-select fields) styled to match your theme and fully integrated into your search results logic. It also includes making AND or OR Logics as well.<br>If your setup requires more filters, custom logic, complex data mappings, or industry-specific filter behavior, you&rsquo;ll receive a quote for the price difference, and work begins only after your approval.</p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Adding more than 4 custom filter fields</li><li>Conditional logic (plan-based, category-based, multi-layered filters)</li><li>Any UI/UX development (sticky filter bar, collapsible filters, mobile-first redesign)</li><li>Custom range sliders, distance filters, or multi-step filter flows</li><li>Saving Searches: Members can save their searches and use next time</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests&nbsp;</strong>(if any) are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp / Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong><br>Implementation plan<br>Estimated delivery timeline<br>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</p><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Unlock Precision Search &mdash; Make Every Visitor Find What They Need</h2><p>Turn your directory into a smart, decision-driven search experience. Help visitors filter by what actually matters &mdash; and connect them to the right listings instantly.</p><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to upgrade your search results into a powerful <strong>conversion engine</strong>.</p>', NULL, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '20260613033220', '', 0, '70d24af34f897cb0dd43aea8b5014a36', 'solutions/custom-search-filters-for-directory-websites', 1, 0, '', 'Order Now', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Customizations', '2026-06-13 10:56:55', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 195.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, 0.00, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', 'Implementation Time', '12_weeks', ' Warranty', ' ', ' ', 'Search Filters', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(564, 101, 'Custom Tabs on Member Profile Pages', '<p><strong>Organize and showcase member information with more clarity and flexibility.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Custom Tabs on Member Profile Pages</strong> service is designed to enhance the functionality and specificity of your Brilliant Directories website, moving beyond the standard profile sections like <strong>Overview</strong>, <strong>Reviews</strong>, and <strong>Articles</strong>.</p><p>This service allows for the creation of unique, custom tabs on member profile pages to perfectly match the needs of your particular niche and significantly improve usability for your visitors. Instead of being limited to the default options, you can add specialized sections such as:</p><ul><li><strong>Press Mentions</strong></li><li><strong>Case Studies</strong></li><li><strong>Client Brands</strong></li><li><strong>Downloads</strong></li></ul><hr><h3>Why Add Custom Tabs?</h3><p>Default profile layouts can become cluttered or generic. By adding tabs, you can separate and highlight specific content like:</p><ul><li><strong>Press / News</strong> &mdash; Show media mentions (can use a custom post type)</li><li><strong>Downloads / Resources</strong> &mdash; Upload brochures, PDFs (via Digital Products)</li><li><strong>Awards &amp; Recognition</strong> &mdash; Display credibility markers</li><li><strong>Case Studies / Success Stories</strong></li><li><strong>Team / Staff</strong> &mdash; Add a human touch to a business profile</li><li><strong>Promotions / Offers</strong> &mdash; Current deals or lead magnets</li><li><strong>Clients Served / Brands</strong> &mdash; Build social proof</li></ul><hr><h2>Approaches to Custom Tabs</h2><p>There are <strong>3 typical approaches</strong> to how tabs can be added:</p><h3><span>Using Post Types</span></h3><p>If your tab will display posts (e.g., photos, news, files), we can create a new post type and connect it as a tab.&nbsp;</p><h3><span>Using Custom Fields</span></h3><p><span>&nbsp;If your tab needs new data input (e.g., team bios, awards), we can customize member dashboard forms to collect and show that info.&nbsp;</span></p><h3 id=\"isPasted\"><span>Using Existing Info, Just Better Organized</span></h3><p>Sometimes, we simply separate what&#39;s already there into its own tab (no new data or post types needed).</p><h3>See how we organized it - just one example</h3><p><strong>1) Members Add their details inside the &ldquo;Additional Details&rdquo; tab</strong><br>Members enter their extra information &mdash; such as <strong>&ldquo;collaboration preferences&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>and <strong>&ldquo;Give two sentences about your brand and your mission&rdquo;</strong> &mdash; directly within the Profile Details section of their dashboard.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/ec183b000d63c46973a2a5533c76fe82dfb0144d.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 432.077px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"72dd6dbe 7472 4cf2 b0bb b1a5c6180d37\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"432\"></p><p><br><strong>2) Instead of showing this &ldquo;collaboration preferences&rdquo; under the default Overview tab, we create a dedicated custom tab for it</strong><br>This organizes the information more elegantly and gives it clear visibility, making the profile look polished and professional.<br><img src=\"/images/solutions/97d31f129a2fe8cd765b31fabf908fa8d22596ec.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 462.757px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"000c5678 f30c 4370 88a8 fbb4110a178e\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1247\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Faster access to relevant info without endless scrolling</li><li>Clearer understanding of the business&rsquo;s offerings, credibility, or team</li><li>Better experience leads to more time on site and higher trust</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Cleaner presentation of their expertise and achievements</li><li>Stand out from competitors with unique, structured content</li><li>More qualified inquiries because users know more upfront</li></ul><h3>For Site Owner</h3><ul><li>Better-looking profile pages for all members</li><li>Customizations that fit your niche and boost brand value</li><li>More control over how member content is shown and organized</li><li>Added value that justifies premium plans</li></ul><hr><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $20</strong> &mdash; covers simple implementations like adding one new tab that displays existing or default content (e.g., listings, photo albums, events, etc.).</p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Creating a custom post type</li><li>Adding multiple tabs</li><li>Customizing member dashboard forms (e.g., adding new fields to Contact or Listing forms)</li><li>Implementing custom logic or advanced styling on tab content</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests&nbsp;</strong>(if any) are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp / Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong><br>Implementation plan<br>Estimated delivery timeline<br>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</p><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h3><strong>Ready to Upgrade Your Member Profiles?</strong></h3><p>Add structure, clarity, and value to every member listing.</p><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to get started, and we&rsquo;ll guide you through the best setup for your use case.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'beb0248fdc3b6358645f3155d31e74a7', 'solutions/custom-tabs-on-member-profile-pages', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Customizations', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Custom Tabs', ' ', 'readytoimplement', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(565, 101, 'Add Social Icons to Footer – Brilliant Directories', '<p><strong>Boost engagement and build trust with social icons in your footer</strong></p><p>The <strong>Add Social Icons to Footer &ndash; Brilliant Directories</strong> service lets you display clickable social media icons in your website&rsquo;s footer. This keeps your visitors connected to your brand, encourages engagement, and strengthens trust across all pages of your directory.</p><hr><h2>Why This Feature Matters</h2><p>Your footer is seen on every page. Adding clickable social media icons there creates trust, encourages engagement, and keeps your visitors connected to your brand&mdash;even after they leave your site.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Send us your social links and preferred icon styles</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> We embed the icons into your site&rsquo;s footer, styled to match your branding</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> You approve the layout, color, and icon behavior (e.g., open in new tab)</p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong> We launch&mdash;your footer now builds social momentum passively</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/01fce96608c715cfe7179ef1d5d039eda2d6b0ba.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 391.17px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"c3471619 dac7 4ccf 8658 b76800154814\" width=\"1600\" height=\"823\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Want your visitors to follow and connect with you&mdash;everywhere you are?</h2><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> and turn your footer into a social engagement.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'a94d08c482aeaae37d2c3d413138f61a', 'solutions/add-social-icons-to-footer-%E2%80%93-brilliant-directories', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Footer Icons', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(566, 101, 'Add Mobile App Download Icons to Footer', '<p><strong>Bridge the gap between your site and your app.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Add Mobile App Download Icons to Footer</strong> service adds sleek, recognizable icons to your website&#39;s footer, making it easy for users to find and download your mobile app directly from the Apple App Store and Google Play Store.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Send us your App Store &amp; Play Store links</strong></p><p><strong>Step 2: We embed official download icons</strong> in your footer with a matching design</p><p><strong>Step 3: You approve the placement and styling</strong></p><p><strong>Step 4: We make it live&mdash;visible across your entire site</strong><strong><img src=\"/images/solutions/8b78fe3b7f40fcb191f1a77f28e66a6160b1028b.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 411.623px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"aef3dc06 c6cb 4194 a0ca e088870750c5\" width=\"1600\" height=\"862\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></p><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Ready to turn every page into a download opportunity?</h2><p>Click<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> and boost your app visibility site-wide.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'f4b44634761ccc83d6cb16db7c61035e', 'solutions/add-mobile-app-download-icons-to-footer', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'App Icons', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(567, 101, 'Add Images to Footer', '<p><strong>Create a lasting impression with visual branding.</strong><br>The Add Images to Footer feature allows you to easily display custom images or logos in your website&#39;s footer, perfect for showcasing partner brands, certifications, or trust badges.</p><hr><h2>Why your footer matters</h2><p>The footer is prime real estate often overlooked.<br>By showcasing partner logos, network directories, or trust icons in your footer, you enhance authority, build trust, and subtly drive traffic or brand recognition.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Send us the images you want to add (We will provide the required dimensions/sizes for the images, so you can provide them)</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> We embed the images into your site&rsquo;s footer, styled to match your branding</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> You review and approve the placement, styling, and link destinations</p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong> We make it live&mdash;your footer is now more professional, trusted, and visually engaging</p><hr><p><strong>Example Screenshot #1:</strong><br><img src=\"/images/solutions/5e5f86ed5790b6334021552a442a9846b7794b3a.png\" style=\"width: 729px; height: 400.95px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"79f7c9ed 27f7 42a9 91e0 26bc28a2c598\" width=\"2558\" height=\"1418\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Build trust instantly through visual badges and affiliations</li><li>Get confidence that the site is connected to real networks or organizations</li><li>See visual cues that reinforce the legitimacy of listings and content</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Stand out with your association to verified directories or groups</li><li>Gain more credibility by being listed on a trusted, professional-looking platform</li><li>Increase exposure if their logo or partnership is featured in the footer</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners</h3><ul><li>Promote network directories or sub-brands clearly</li><li>Improve brand recall and overall visual branding</li><li>Add functionality and style to an often-overlooked section</li><li>Reduce bounce by creating a polished, trustworthy experience</li><li>Link footer images to internal/external pages for additional traffic flow</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Want your site footer to do more than just sit there?</h2><p>Click<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>and elevate your brand instantly.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '60be18513feb88d5fe78038494b84c62', 'solutions/add-images-to-footer', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Footer Images', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(568, 101, 'Banner Ads on Header and Footer', '<p><strong>Unlock a new revenue stream for your site.</strong><br>The Banner Ads Manager is a default feature in Brilliant Directories that allows website owners to easily place banner advertisements across their sites.&nbsp;</p><p>Banner ads are a quick and reliable way to generate revenue &mdash; especially when used with third-party platforms like <strong>Google AdSense and Adplugg.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>They can also be used to promote your own business, feature sponsors, or highlight partner promotions directly on your directory.</p><p>Our team can help you make the most of this built-in feature &mdash; ensuring banners are placed in the right areas for maximum visibility and business impact. We&rsquo;ll help you decide where banners should be visible or hidden, how they can benefit your business, and how they can increase revenue for your website. Whether you&rsquo;re looking to advertise your services, feature sponsors, or run any kind of promotion, we&rsquo;ll guide you through using this feature effectively with free of cost.</p><h2>Banners can be placed in the following areas of your site:</h2><ul><li>Sidebars (up to 5 banners - rectangle or square)</li><li>Footer (1 horizontal banner)</li><li>Header (1 horizontal banner)</li><li>Below Header (1 horizontal banner)</li></ul><hr><h2>How We Can Help</h2><p>Even though this is a default Brilliant Directories feature, many users don&rsquo;t take full advantage of it &mdash; and that&rsquo;s where we come in. We can help you set up, optimize, and position your banner ads in a way that supports your goals. From choosing where banners should appear to understanding how they can help grow your business, we make the process simple and strategic.</p><p><strong>Here&rsquo;s how we can help you use it effectively:</strong></p><p>✅ Identify the best banner locations for maximum visibility and engagement.<br>✅ Explain how banner placements can help increase leads and revenue.<br>✅ Help you use banners to advertise your own business or promote anything you choose.<br>✅ Ensure banners enhance your website&rsquo;s appearance instead of cluttering it.</p><hr><h2>See It In Action</h2><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/banners-adds.gif?tr=w-390,f-webp,q-75\" style=\"width: 752px; height: 549.685px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"16bb8cb8 af39 4e18 8990 37986dca2354\" width=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"550\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Site Owners:</h3><p>Banner ads help you generate passive revenue, promote your services, and create space for advertisers &mdash; all using a feature that already exists in your site. Strategic placement makes your directory more valuable and more professional.</p><h3>For Visitors:</h3><p>Well-placed banners keep visitors informed about relevant offers, events, or trusted partners without overwhelming their browsing experience. They make your website look more dynamic and connected &mdash; turning regular traffic into meaningful engagement.</p><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2><p>If you have banners ready, or want to explore what&rsquo;s possible with BD-based banner placements:<br>Click<strong>&nbsp;&quot;Order Now&quot;</strong> to begin.<br>We&rsquo;ll guide you through what we need and what&rsquo;s possible for your site.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'd9c667fd77f7022f28503dfc84b5395c', 'solutions/banner-ads-on-header-and-footer', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Customizations,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Banner Ads', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(569, 101, 'Social Media Icons in Header', '<p><strong>Boost Visibility, Drive Engagement From the Top of Your Site</strong></p><p>The <strong>Social Media Icons in Header</strong> tool adds sleek, clickable social media icons to your website&#39;s header, making it easy for visitors to connect with your brand and follow you on different platforms.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Send us the URL of all your relevant social media accounts/profiles.</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> We embed the icons in the site header, styled to match your branding</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> You approve the look and behavior (open in new tab, hover effects, etc.)</p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong> We go live&mdash;your site now connects instantly to your social platforms</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/e44813022f15932eeb44bbb899ad4285fd1045f7.webp\" style=\"width: 756px; height: 231.84px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"dead1f46 4376 47ed bcad 4188c947b7c6\" width=\"1100\" height=\"341\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Make it easier for users to connect with you