er-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">E-E-A-T</td><td class=\"essential-col\" style=\"width: 37.6%; background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">❌</td><td style=\"width: 37.1931%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">✔ Included</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 25.0667%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">AI/LLM Visibility</td><td class=\"essential-col\" style=\"width: 37.6%; background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">❌</td><td style=\"width: 37.1931%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">✔ Included</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 25.0667%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Content Strategy</td><td class=\"essential-col\" style=\"width: 37.6%; background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">❌</td><td style=\"width: 37.1931%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">10&ndash;100 ideas + silo map</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 25.0667%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Implementation</td><td class=\"essential-col\" style=\"width: 37.6%; background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Separate service &mdash; explore plans at <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/seo\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bdgrowthsuite.com/seo</a></td><td style=\"width: 37.1931%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Separate service &mdash; explore plans at <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/seo\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bdgrowthsuite.com/seo</a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2>Deliverables in this Essential SEO Audit Service</h2><ul><li>PDF audit report</li><li>Keyphrase map based on strategy call</li><li>Priority Fix List</li><li>Essential SEO Improvement Checklist</li><li>Delivery within<strong>&nbsp;5 business days</strong></li></ul><hr><h2>Ready to Begin?</h2><p>Your Essential SEO Audit sets the foundation for long-term visibility, clarity, and search performance &mdash; without heavy investment.</p><p>Click <strong>&quot;Order Now&quot;</strong> to get your Audit started.</p></div>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '9172498ef04eaa1497b0f5ca052d202f', 'solutions/essential-seo-audit', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Consultation', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Essential SEO Audit', 'Essential SEO Audit', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(575, 101, 'Strategic SEO Audit (Advanced)', '<p><strong>A deep, comprehensive, and high-precision SEO blueprint for large or fast-growing Brilliant Directories websites.</strong></p><p><strong>Or, if you are very serious about SEO even at your early stages, this is the right choice.&nbsp;</strong></p><p>In the Strategic SEO Audit (Advanced), we begin by understanding your broader vision, what you want to achieve, what you&rsquo;ve already tried, and what challenges you&#39;re experiencing. This helps us give you clear direction&mdash;what to do, what to stop doing, and what to prioritize based on your goals.</p><p>This audit is built for directory owners managing multi-city, multi-category, multi&ndash;post-type, or content-heavy BD installations &mdash; or anyone aiming for long-term, scalable organic growth.</p><p>It uncovers hidden issues, maps your full technical landscape, strengthens your site architecture, and provides a complete <strong>multi-month SEO roadmap</strong> designed specifically for how BD websites rank, scale, and build authority.</p><p>If your goals, traffic expectations, or you got the execution budgets, this audit delivers the depth and clarity required to move with confidence.</p><hr><h2>What&rsquo;s Included in the Strategic SEO Audit (Advanced)</h2><h3>1. Full GA4 &amp; Search Console Setup + Diagnostic</h3><ul><li>GA4 full setup or cleanup</li><li>Event configuration and validation</li><li>Search Console configuration &amp; verification</li><li>Indexing issues analysis</li><li>URL inspection pattern review</li><li>Recommendations for any important BD tools that are not configured</li><li>Coverage warnings &amp; errors triage</li></ul><blockquote>Note: We don&rsquo;t fix errors reported in search console or in any external tool, but your report will clearly tell you what needs to be addressed.</blockquote><hr><h3>2. Deep Review of Static Pages</h3><p><strong>If you have 50+ static pages, no problem &mdash; up to 60 pages are fully covered.</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">We review and evaluate:</p><ul><li>All major landing pages</li><li>Core informational pages</li><li>Lead-gen pages</li><li>SEO template usage</li><li>Keyword alignment &amp; content depth</li><li>E-E-A-T elements</li><li>Internal linking opportunities</li></ul><hr><h3>3. Post Types &mdash; Full Deep Dive (Up to 4 Post Types)</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">For each included post type, we evaluate:</p><ul><li>Results pages</li><li>Detail pages</li><li>Category based URLs</li><li>Pagination logic</li><li>SEO token usage</li><li>Keyword strategy per post type</li><li>Content gaps &amp; ranking opportunities</li></ul><p>We also verify the relationship between post types and overall site architecture.</p><hr><h3>4. Full-Suite Schema / Structured Data Review</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">Schema coverage across every page we audit, including:</p><ul><li>Organization</li><li>LocalBusiness</li><li>Review/Rating</li><li>Article</li><li>Event</li><li>Service</li><li>Custom BD token-based schema</li></ul><p>Recommendations are given for correct placement, structure, and schema expansion.</p><hr><h3>5. Member Profiles &mdash; Detailed SEO Evaluation</h3><ul><li>Member Results listings</li><li>Member Profile (Detail) page depth</li><li>Content quality</li><li>Internal trust signals</li><li>Keyword opportunities</li><li>E-E-A-T alignment for higher credibility &amp; ranking</li></ul><hr><h3>6. Deep Technical SEO &amp; Site Architecture</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">This includes:</p><ul><li>Crawl depth mapping</li><li>Orphan page identification</li><li>Breadcrumb structure review</li><li>Canonicalization checks</li><li>URL taxonomy mapping</li><li>Pagination issues</li><li>Internal linking flow</li><li>Mobile SEO &amp; UX issues</li><li>Core Web Vitals (speed, layout, responsiveness)</li><li>Lazy loading &amp; render-blocking assets</li></ul><p>This is where large BD sites often gain significant clarity and performance improvements.</p><hr><h3>7. Content Strategy &amp; Keyword Architecture</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">You receive:</p><ul><li>Primary keyword hierarchy</li><li>Supporting secondary keyword map</li><li>Topic clusters &amp; silo structure</li><li>10&ndash;100 content ideas tailored to your niche</li><li>Recommendations for scalable content expansion</li></ul><hr><h3>8. AI/LLM Visibility Strategy (ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity)</h3><p style=\"margin:0px;\">We analyze and advise for:</p><ul><li>AI-friendly content formatting</li><li>FAQ embedding opportunities</li><li>Data-structured answers for LLMs</li><li>High-confidence snippet patterns</li><li>Member-data and post-type visibility in LLM ecosystems</li></ul><p>This is included because BD site owners increasingly see traffic coming from AI systems, not just Google.</p><hr><h2>Strategic vs Essential SEO Audit (Comparison)</h2><p>If your implementation budget aligns with <strong>$1,000&ndash;$2,000/mo</strong>, or your site operates in multiple regions, categories, or content layers, the Strategic Audit is the most suitable choice. It is designed for deeper fixes, broader scaling, and long-term content growth.</p><p>If your budget is lighter <strong>($250&ndash;$500/mo)</strong>, start with the <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/tools/essential-seo-audit\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Essential Audit&nbsp;</a>&mdash; it&rsquo;s more than enough to tighten your fundamentals and fix your most important ranking blockers.</p><table class=\"table table-bordered seo-comparison\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width: 22.3232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Area</th><th style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Essential Audit ($250)</th><th style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Strategic Audit (Advanced) ($1500)<br>&nbsp;(This very service)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 22.3232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Delivery Time</td><td style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Under <strong>5 days</strong></td><td style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Under <strong>2 weeks</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 22.3232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Static Pages Reviewed</td><td style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Up to <strong>12</strong></td><td style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Up to <strong>60</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 22.3232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Post Types Reviewed</td><td style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\"><strong>1</strong></td><td style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Up to <strong>4</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 22.3232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Member Results Pages</td><td style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">✔ Included</td><td style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">✔ Included</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 22.3232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Member Detail Pages</td><td style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">✔ Included</td><td style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">✔ Included</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 22.3232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Keyword Strategy Call</td><td style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Short call</td><td style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Full