232%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Implementation</td><td style=\"width: 36.4773%;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Separate service &mdash; see <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/seo\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bdgrowthsuite.com/seo</a></td><td style=\"width: 41.1241%;background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Separate service &mdash; see&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/seo\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bdgrowthsuite.com/seo</a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2>Deliverables in the Strategic SEO Audit (Advanced)</h2><ul><li>Full Strategic Audit PDF</li><li>Complete keyword hierarchy &amp; content map</li><li>Multi-month SEO roadmap</li><li>Schema plan &amp; placement recommendations</li><li>Crawl structure map</li><li>Site architecture &amp; technical issue list</li><li>Recommendations for long-term scaling</li><li>Delivery within <strong>2 weeks</strong></li></ul><hr><h2>Ready to Elevate Your SEO?</h2><p>The Strategic SEO Audit (Advanced) gives you a complete blueprint for scaling visibility, rankings, content, and authority across your entire Brilliant Directories ecosystem.</p><p>Click <strong>&quot;Order Now&quot;</strong> to begin.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '1039c0bf29ddbe3c1ded3663390a17c3', 'solutions/strategic-seo-audit-advanced', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'SEO', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 1500.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'flagship_service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'SEO Audit', 'SEO Audit', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(576, 101, 'Tawk.to Implementation for Live Chat', '<p><strong>Engage visitors in real time, answer questions instantly, and convert traffic into leads with live chat.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px;\">Enable Tawk.to live chat on your BD site and start talking to visitors instantly &mdash; boost trust, answer faster, and capture more leads on the spot.</blockquote><hr><h2>What This Service Does</h2><p>Visitors often have quick questions before taking action. If they can&rsquo;t get answers instantly, they leave. The Tawk.to Live Chat Integration makes sure they stay &mdash; it enables real-time communication right on your Brilliant Directories site, supporting sales, support, and lead generation. Real-time communication = higher conversions.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> We install and activate Tawk.to on your BD site.<br><strong>Step 2:</strong> You create a free Tawk.to account (if you don&rsquo;t have one).<br><strong>Step 3:</strong> We configure the chat in your BD site with the respective script from Tawk.to.<br><strong>Step 4:</strong> Start chatting with visitors instantly from your Tawk.to dashboard.</p><hr><h2>See It In Action</h2><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/tawk.gif\" style=\"width: 636px; height: 356.16px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"1c6d707b 48bf 4506 a6a1 0f64c961c27f\" width=\"800\" height=\"451\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>How Tawk.to Live Chat Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Instant support without needing to call or email</li><li>More confidence while browsing your directory or joining</li><li>Real-time engagement builds trust and speeds up decisions</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>More inquiries and leads from engaged users</li><li>Fewer missed opportunities due to delayed responses</li><li>Adds credibility when live support is available on the site</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners</h3><ul><li>Capture leads on the spot while they browse</li><li>Reduce support tickets by handling questions in real time</li><li>Monitor traffic and behavior with Tawk.to&rsquo;s built-in visitor tracking</li><li>Easy to manage from desktop or mobile app</li></ul><hr><div><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $20</strong> &mdash; covers installing and activating Tawk.to on your Brilliant Directories site, adding the embed script, and ensuring the widget loads correctly on all pages.</p><p>If your setup requires custom behavior or extra logic, you&rsquo;ll receive a quote for the price difference, and work begins only after your approval.<br><strong>Depending on your needs, we might suggest a different Live Chat solution that&rsquo;s a better fit.<br></strong></p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Different chat behavior for logged-in vs. non-logged-in users</li><li>Auto-capture lead when a visitor asks a question</li><li>Adding page-specific rules</li><li>Custom styling of the chat launcher/button</li><li>Integrating Tawk.to visitor data with BD activity logs</li></ul></div><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests (if any)&nbsp;</strong>are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Ready to engage your traffic with live chat support?</h2><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to get started and we&rsquo;ll implement it for you.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '562fe1f9566ec4a0256b3483afa517c5', 'solutions/tawk-to-implementation-for-live-chat', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Integrations,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Tawk Chat', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' ');
