(577, 101, 'Intercom Live Chat for Brilliant Directories', '<p><strong>Real-Time Conversations. Happier Visitors. More Conversions</strong></p><p>The <strong>Intercom Live Chat Integration</strong> adds instant, real-time messaging to your Brilliant Directories website &mdash; letting you speak with visitors while they&rsquo;re actively browsing. Whether you&rsquo;re helping users choose the right membership plan, answering questions about listings, or supporting returning members, Intercom enables quick, human-to-human conversations that increase trust and boost conversions dramatically.</p><hr><h2>Why Intercom?</h2><p>Visitors today won&rsquo;t wait. If they have questions, they want answers&nbsp;<strong>now</strong>. Intercom lets you chat with them instantly &mdash; turning confusion into clarity and hesitation into signups.<br>Whether you&#39;re selling memberships, services, or simply helping people navigate your directory, Intercom gives you a direct communication channel exactly when visitors need it.</p><hr><h2>What You Get</h2><ul><li><strong>Always accessible:</strong> Chat bubble visible globally &mdash; or only on selected pages</li><li><strong>Smart greetings:&nbsp;</strong>Show different welcome messages based on page or behavior</li><li><strong>Mobile-friendly:</strong> Works perfectly across all devices</li><li><strong>Direct inbox connection:</strong> Messages land inside your Intercom workspace instantly</li><li><strong>Optional integrations:</strong> Connect with your CRM, help desk, or lead capture flows</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> You create a free or paid Intercom account<br><strong>Step 2:</strong> We configure your chat settings &mdash; welcome messages, team inbox, hours, etc.<br><strong>Step 3:</strong> We install Intercom&rsquo;s JavaScript snippet on your BD site<br><strong>Step 4:</strong> You&#39;re live &mdash; and able to chat with visitors in real time</p><hr><h2>See It In Action</h2><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/49bdac48caf7bfd47201b818959b16540ac84965.gif\" style=\"width: 701px; height: 435.103px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"7f4d913b 646a 40e9 a48e 04dd6fd74c4c\" width=\"701\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"435\"></p><hr><h2>Common Use Cases</h2><ul><li>Help new visitors decide on a membership plan</li><li>Answer questions while users browse listings</li><li>Capture and qualify leads directly through chat</li><li>Reduce support emails by 30&ndash;50%</li><li>Support members instantly when they face issues</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><ul><li>Higher conversions and more signups through real-time engagement</li><li>Reduce support workload by resolving questions instantly</li><li>Capture visitor intent before they bounce</li><li>View and manage all conversations from Intercom&rsquo;s dashboard</li><li>Track user behavior and show targeted messages</li><li>Enhance brand professionalism with modern live chat</li></ul><hr><div class=\"intercom-price-clarity\"><h2>Pricing &amp; Process</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $20</strong> &mdash; covers installing Intercom on your Brilliant Directories site, adding the JavaScript snippet, enabling the global chat bubble, and confirming that messages flow correctly into your Intercom inbox.</p><p>If your setup requires advanced behavior, targeting, or deeper workflows, you&rsquo;ll receive a quote for the price difference, and work begins only after your approval.</p><p><strong>Depending on your needs, we might suggest a different Live Chat solution that&rsquo;s a better fit.<br></strong></p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Page-specific chat rules (e.g., show only on pricing, search results, or join page)</li><li>Smart greeting variations based on page, device, or visitor behavior</li><li>Custom triggers or automated lead-capture flows</li><li>Custom styling of the Intercom launcher or embedded UI</li><li>Conditional behavior for logged-in vs. non-logged-in users</li></ul></div><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests (if any)&nbsp;</strong>are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Turn website visitors into conversations &mdash; and conversations into conversions</h2><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to get Intercom live chat integrated into your Brilliant Directories site.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'dee5d09f54f6bfdad08115b211bf17a0', 'solutions/intercom-live-chat-for-brilliant-directories', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Integrations', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(578, 101, 'Zoho CRM Integration for Members Signup', '<p><strong>Automatically Add New Members to Your Zoho CRM List</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px;\">Turn every new signup into a subscriber &mdash; and automate your email marketing from day one.</blockquote><p>The Zoho CRM Integration for Member Signup tool connects your Brilliant Directories signup process directly to your Zoho CRM list. Every time a user becomes a member on your site, their details are instantly added to your chosen list &mdash; helping you grow your audience automatically, trigger welcome emails, and keep members engaged without any manual work.</p><hr><h2>Why This Matters</h2><p>If you collect members on your directory and manage your marketing inside Zoho CRM, manually adding each new signup becomes messy, slow, and error-prone.</p><p>This integration removes all friction.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>New members are added to your list instantly, giving you:</strong></p><ul><li>Stronger onboarding</li><li>Automated welcome emails</li><li>Better engagement</li><li>Cleaner, more consistent data</li></ul><p>No exporting . No manual uploading . No headaches . No missed subscribers.</p><hr><h2>What It Does</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">Whenever a user becomes a member on your BD site &mdash; free or paid &mdash; this integration:</p><ul><li>Captures their signup details</li><li>Sends them to Zoho CRM automatically</li><li>Keeps your subscriber list updated in real time</li></ul><p>Your list grows with every new member &mdash; hands-free.</p><hr><h2>What&rsquo;s Included</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>Data pushed from BD Signup &rarr; Zoho CRM</strong></p><ul><li>First Name</li><li>Last Name</li><li>Email Address</li><li>Membership Plan</li><li>Signup Date/Time</li><li>Phone Number (if collected)</li><li>Company/Organization (if collected)</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> You provide your Zoho CRM API Key + Access Token<br><strong>Step 2:</strong> We connect your BD signup form to your Zoho CRM list<br><strong>Step 3:</strong> New members sign up as normal<br><strong>Step 4:</strong> Their details instantly pushed to Zoho CRM</p><p>Everything runs automatically &mdash; no extra steps for you or your team.</p><hr><h2>See It Action</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Members fill the signup form<br><strong>Step 2:</strong> Member details instantly pushed to Zoho CRM</p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><ul><li>Automatically grow your Zoho CRM list</li><li>Eliminate manual list updates forever</li><li>Improve retention through automated onboarding emails</li><li>Trigger email flows, offers, or drip campaigns</li><li>Keep your email marketing synced with BD signups</li><li>Boost engagement without extra work</li></ul><hr><div class=\"cc-price-clarity\"><h2>Price Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $50</strong> &mdash; covers connecting your Brilliant Directories signup flow to your Zoho CRM list, pushing new members instantly with their core details (name, email, plan, signup time, phone/company if collected).</p><p>If your setup requires tagging, segmentation, or additional data mapping, you&rsquo;ll receive a quote for the price difference, and work begins only after your approval.</p><p><strong>Depending on your needs, we might suggest a different CRM solution that&rsquo;s a better fit.<br></strong></p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Applying Zoho CRM tags or interests</li><li>Sending different member types to different lists</li><li>Mapping extra fields or custom form data</li></ul></div><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests (if any)&nbsp;</strong>are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Want every new member pushed automatically to Zoho CRM?</h2><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to activate Zoho CRM Integration for Member Signups.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '3ebd9c0e3600dcf657c886de528cda96', 'solutions/zoho-crm-integration-for-members-signup', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Integrations', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 50.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Zoho CRM', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(579, 101, 'Custom CRM for Brilliant Directories', '<p><strong>Built 100% Around Your Workflow &mdash; Not a Generic Plugin.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">We design and build a CRM that works exactly the way your directory business needs &mdash; nothing extra, nothing missing.</blockquote><p>Every BD site runs differently. Your categories, plans, signup flow, data structure, lead process, and internal workflow are unique &mdash; so your CRM should be too.<br><br><strong>That&rsquo;s why this isn&rsquo;t a pre-made plugin.<br></strong>We meet you &rarr; study your process &rarr; design the flow &rarr; build the exact CRM that removes your daily pain.</p><p>No more switching between six admin screens, no more messy tabs.<br><strong>Just your CRM. Purpose-built. Clean. Fast. Centralized.</strong></p><hr><h2>How We Build Your Custom CRM</h2><ul><li>&nbsp;Understand your exact workflow &mdash; your data fields, member types, approval steps, lead process, everything.</li><li>&nbsp;Blueprint your CRM dashboard &mdash; only the buttons, filters, and actions you actually use.</li><li>&nbsp;Develop + integrate inside your BD admin &mdash; visually clean, zero reloads, lightning-fast.</li><li>&nbsp;Fine-tune with you live &mdash; until it fits your daily workflow perfectly.</li><li>&nbsp;Support + improvements as your business grows.</li></ul><hr><h2>Why this works brilliantly</h2><ul><li><span data-teams=\"true\" id=\"isPasted\">Your unique pain got the &quot;To-The-Point&quot; Fix.</span></li><li><span data-teams=\"true\" id=\"isPasted\">Your workflow is built. Not that you need to learn a new workflow.</span></li><li><span data-teams=\"true\" id=\"isPasted\">You dictate the terms. CRM built on it.<br><br></span></li></ul><hr><h2>Some Examples</h2><p><strong>Example 1:</strong><br>For a client, we built a Member-level Management CRM to manage members faster without navigating multiple BD admin pages. They needed instant search, tags, statuses, approvals, and messaging &mdash; all from one unified dashboard.</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/Famous_crm.gif\" alt=\"c9d86013 c3ae 4baf be70 bce48e19cb84\" width=\"493\" height=\"304.167\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></p><p><br><strong>Example 2:</strong><br>For another client, we built an event-level supplier management dashboard. They needed one place to control suppliers, track incomplete fields, assign labels, and manage attending staff &mdash; all instantly and from one screen.</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/Motiv8_CRM.gif\" alt=\"c9d86013 c3ae 4baf be70 bce48e19cb84\" width=\"493\" height=\"304.167\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></p><p><br></p><p>Each dashboard is branded to match the site&rsquo;s theme and workflow &mdash; fully tailored.</p><hr><h2>Who It&rsquo;s For</h2><ul><li>Admins managing onboarding, support, or approvals</li><li>Sales teams handling lead qualification</li><li>Site owners needing a real-time command center</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p>The CRM is built directly inside your Brilliant Directories admin panel. It connects to your live member database and enables real-time editing, filtering, messaging, and approvals &mdash; without refreshing or navigating away. Built using BD&rsquo;s architecture, it&rsquo;s lightweight, fast, and scalable.</p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Faster support and cleaner listings</li><li>Quicker responses = better experience site-wide</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Faster plan changes, approvals, and updates</li><li>Timely communication</li><li>More professional and responsive platform</li></ul><h3>For Directory Owners</h3><ul><li>Complete control from one dashboard</li><li>Saves hours weekly</li><li>Improved team productivity and data accuracy</li><li>Less dependency on multiple admin modules</li></ul><hr><h2>Compatibility</h2><ul><li>Works on all Brilliant Directories updates and themes</li><li>Designed using BD&rsquo;s native database architecture</li><li>Fully secure and performance optimized</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; and Fill few details</strong><br>Submit your request.<br>Unlike other tools where you pay full upfront, here you will only <strong>pay a small</strong> <strong>commitment fee</strong> of $50.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">This commitment fee covers a short consulting/brainstorming call where we understand your ideas, share ours, and finalize the scope.</blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Schedule Your Discovery Call</strong><br>Once paid, you&rsquo;ll get an email to book your session. We also follow up via email and WhatsApp for easy coordination.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Define Scope of Work aligned to your Vision</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll discuss your goals, finalize flow of the feature, and brainstorm features/layouts that align with your vision.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Review &amp; Confirm</strong><br>You&rsquo;ll receive the investment needs and timelines.<br>If you move forward, the&nbsp;<strong>full amount is credited</strong><strong>&nbsp;to your final invoice.</strong><br>If not, the clarity and ideas from the session are yours to keep.</p><hr><h2>Want to simplify management and save hours every week?</h2><p>Get your Custom CRM for Brilliant Directories &mdash; the one dashboard to manage everything.<br>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to integrate this CRM module into your admin today.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '2ae2587b62ecc01d8c492fe34ec20e24', 'solutions/custom-crm-for-brilliant-directories', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'CRM', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 750.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'starts_from', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Custom CRM', ' ', 'fully_custom', ' ', 50.00, 'deposit'),
(580, 101, 'Members Approval Plugin for Directory Websites', '<p><strong>Verify Members Before They Go Live and Showcase Only Trusted Profiles.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Members Approval Plugin</strong> for Brilliant Directories ensures your directory maintains credibility by letting admins review documents, approve or reject members, and display trust badges on verified profiles.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Build trust, reduce spam, and give your platform the credibility it deserves.</strong></blockquote><h2>Why Approving Your Members Matters</h2><p>Letting just anyone list in your directory can hurt your credibility. Member approvals give you control over quality, ensure real people are featured, and help prevent spam, fake profiles, or irrelevant signups.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>A solid approval system:</strong></p><ul><li>Establishes credibility from day one</li><li>Encourages verified members only</li><li>Protects your directory from low-quality or fake listings</li></ul><hr><h2>Perfect for These Business Types</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\">Some industries demand more trust than others. This tool is ideal for directories featuring:</p><ul><li>Doctors, therapists, counselors</li><li>Driving instructors, fitness trainers</li><li>Tutors, teachers, coaches</li><li>Real estate agents, contractors, builders</li><li>Agencies, consultants, or freelancers offering services</li><li>Any business requiring credentials, licenses, or public interaction</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Members upload their documents or whatever you might demand (ID, certification, license, etc.) in their dashboard.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/e482c6cb0f615d167df7761df1d6dca9734d128b.gif\" width=\"662\" height=\"371\" alt=\"member upload example\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></p><p><br><strong>Step 2:</strong> Admin reviews pending submissions under the &ldquo;Not Verified&rdquo; list.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/memberapproval.gif\" width=\"664\" height=\"372\" alt=\"admin approval example\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></p><p><br><strong>Step 3:</strong> Admin approves or rejects the profile.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong> If approved &rarr; a <strong>Verified / Trusted Badge</strong> appears on the public profile.</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/523327155d556097f7d8cf7c604e67e58fa86a24.png\" width=\"520\" height=\"324\" alt=\"trust badge example\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></p><p><br><strong>Step 5:</strong> If rejected &rarr; member stays unverified until corrected documents are submitted.</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/0c3b72912e9b87fa4e368f055f13e55f05983571.png\" style=\"width: 398px; height: 437.484px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" width=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" alt=\"0c3b72912e9b87fa4e368f055f13e55f05983571\" height=\"437\"></p><hr><h3 id=\"isPasted\">How It Helps Visitors</h3><ul><li>Confidence that all members are verified and trustworthy</li><li>See visible trust badges on approved profiles</li><li>Know they&rsquo;re engaging with real people and businesses</li></ul><h3>How It Helps Members</h3><ul><li>A structured way to submit documents for admin review</li><li>Earn a trust badge that helps them stand out</li><li>Gain credibility and improve conversion rates</li></ul><h3>How It Helps Site Owners</h3><ul><li>Add an extra layer of verification and control</li><li>Filter out fake members</li><li>Boost your site&rsquo;s reputation by showcasing only trusted members</li></ul><hr><h2>Implementation Steps</h2><p><strong>We&rsquo;ve streamlined our process to be fast and friction less:</strong></p><p><strong>Step 1:</strong>Click &ldquo;<strong>Order Now</strong>&rdquo; to submit your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2:&nbsp;</strong>We&rsquo;ll reach out via <strong>email&nbsp;</strong>and <strong>Whats App&nbsp;</strong>and, if needed, schedule a quick <strong>Zoom&nbsp;</strong>or <strong>Google Meet</strong> to clarify details before implementation.</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong>You&rsquo;ll receive an invoice (if it&rsquo;s a paid tool/service).</p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong>We request access to your BD admin to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 5:</strong>We implement it. You review and approve.</p><p><br></p><h2>Ready to Build Real Trust and Quality in Your Directory?</h2><p>Stop letting unverified members weaken your platform.<br>Click &ldquo;<strong>Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to activate trusted member approvals on your Brilliant Directories site.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '29fedf120e5e399d863e72d2296fa667', 'solutions/members-approval-plugin-for-directory-websites', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Customizations', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 1800.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', ' ', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Approval Plugin', 'Members Approval Plugin', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, 'deposit'),
(581, 101, 'Search Results Buttons', '<p><strong>Tailored Buttons That Match Your Business Model</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">Make your search results work smarter &mdash; not generic.</blockquote><p>On every<strong>&nbsp;Business Card</strong> in the search results, the action buttons (<strong>View Profile, See Phone Number, Send Messag</strong><strong>e,</strong> etc.) shape how users interact with your directory.<br>This service focuses on replacing, redesigning, or repurposing those default buttons based on your niche and user intent.<br><br>Instead of one-size-fits-all buttons, we define and implement custom actions that match your business model, improve conversions, and guide users exactly where you want them to go.</p><hr><h2>Use Cases (For Directory Listing Actions)</h2><p>Every click on a Business Listing Card matters. If the action button doesn&rsquo;t match what your visitor intends to do, they won&rsquo;t convert &mdash; no matter how strong your listing data is.<br>Different directory niches need different actions:</p><ul><li><strong>Tutor directories:</strong> &ldquo;Schedule Meeting&rdquo;</li><li><strong>Restaurant directories:</strong> &ldquo;Currently Open&rdquo; / &ldquo;Closed&rdquo;</li><li><strong>Real estate directories:</strong> &ldquo;Request Tour&rdquo; / &ldquo;Download Brochure&rdquo;</li><li><strong>Doctor &amp; clinic directories:</strong> &ldquo;Book Appointment&rdquo;</li></ul><p>We align button actions with your niche, business logic, and user intent to drive better engagement and higher-quality leads.</p><hr><h2>Examples of Custom Buttons We Build</h2><ul><li>Schedule a Meeting</li><li>Request a Quote</li><li>Get Directions</li><li>Download Menu / Brochure</li><li>Book Appointment</li><li>WhatsApp</li><li>View Availability (Open/Closed status)</li><li>View Products / Services</li></ul><p>Buttons can also be conditional &mdash; shown based on category, membership plan, or listing data.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Note:</strong> Additional customization (advanced logic, unique button behaviors, multi-step rules, or niche-specific flows) may require extra charges.</blockquote><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p>Step 1: You share your niche, goals, and desired button actions<br>Step 2: We review your BD site and suggest custom CTA options<br>Step 3: Once approved, we implement.</p><hr><h2>See It Action</h2><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/f185c0688e5c3011a38ca43c6324d38a5fe52ed2.png\" width=\"1600\" height=\"785\" id=\"isPasted\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" alt=\"9QjrZ4AAAAGSURBVAMAF8PtVG TNB0AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">$20</span> &mdash;</strong> covers creating up to three custom action buttons with your chosen text, style, and link.</p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>More than 3 buttons</li><li>Custom pop-ups or lead forms</li><li>Dynamic logic (e.g., Open/Closed, availability)</li><li>Advanced tracking or analytics</li><li>Any advanced customization (unique behaviors, multi-step rules, niche-specific logic)</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests&nbsp;</strong>(if any) are quoted separately after review &mdash;<strong>&nbsp;nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Ready to add niche specific CTAs?</h2><p>Don&rsquo;t settle for generic CTAs. Guide your users with buttons that match your business.<br>Click<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to customize your search results buttons.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'e2965756d0f648c90039b3b09338f574', 'solutions/search-results-buttons', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Search Buttons', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(582, 101, 'Enhanced Member Card Elements in Search Results', '<p><strong>Turn Static Listings into Interactive, Lead-Generating Cards with advanced features.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Enhanced Member Card Elements in Search Results</strong> service transforms your Brilliant Directories listings into visually engaging, high-converting cards that drive trust, engagement, and action at a glance.</p><p>Upgrade your search results experience by adding elements to the cards on search results &mdash; without doing a complete heavy design project.</p><hr><h2>Why This Service Matters</h2><p>Most Brilliant Directories search results show basic info &mdash; name, title, maybe a button or two.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/66a100853bb724246846ffb891333225156b6f8a.png\" style=\"width: 761px; height: 365.785px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"0d97e498 390e 4924 96d4 c5b5a78c9da1\" width=\"761\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"366\"></p><p>That&rsquo;s not enough to convert today&rsquo;s visitors. Your members lose visibility, and your site doesn&rsquo;t perform to its full potential.</p><p>With <strong>Enhanced Search Results Member Cards</strong>, we unlock the true potential of your directory by adding advanced, interactive elements that drive trust, engagement, and action &mdash; all at a glance.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/58b61432d3a86f8db4e4c0d5d6bd366a21b0f002.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 467.87px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"2c7d52eb 76f5 454e 93c9 ba90b9be6c96\" width=\"1744\" height=\"1072\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>What We Can Add to Search Result Cards</h2><h3>Trust &amp; Status Badges</h3><p>Display badges like &ldquo;<strong>Verified</strong>,&rdquo; &ldquo;<strong>Top Rated</strong>,&rdquo; &ldquo;<strong>Best in Class</strong>,&rdquo; or &ldquo;<strong>Certified</strong>&rdquo; to create instant credibility.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/276e637936e2d735df0a7fd5ccdd24093ffb05bb.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 593.147px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"fad42c43 843f 43e4 babd b61a7ff28ec3\" width=\"1610\" height=\"1254\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3>Visual Feature Icons</h3><p>Add small icons for offerings like &ldquo;<strong>Home Delivery</strong>,&rdquo; &ldquo;<strong>Open Now</strong>,&rdquo; &ldquo;<strong>Pet Friendly</strong>,&rdquo; or &ldquo;<strong>Women-Owned</strong>&rdquo; to make listings visually informative.</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/959449ebcae098e5744fd536bc887896378c55e4.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 196.693px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"0fd8d4e5 ab0c 42ff a783 4f15c8151033\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"197\"></p><h3>Dynamic Action Buttons</h3><p>We restructure and style your CTA buttons for maximum interaction:</p><ul><li>View Listing</li><li>Send Message</li><li>See Phone Number (toggle functionality)</li><li>Visit Website (optional)</li></ul><p>Buttons are styled, color-coded, and positioned for <strong>mobile-first behavior</strong>.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/08facc0d564cfd10658a333bab63e867b051637d.png\" style=\"width: 749px; height: 232.19px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"d5792b78 dbc5 4d92 a28b e9408de228a0\" width=\"1722\" height=\"536\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3>Ratings &amp; Reviews Block</h3><p>Add star ratings and review counts clearly and consistently &mdash; boosting confidence and encouraging profile visits.</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/8f146bc7364d5102ecc1838ad4b8ab030f71b658.png\" style=\"width: 764px; height: 216.467px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"afc2b137 a187 48f2 90d7 dd02eaefec33\" width=\"764\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"216\"></p><h3>Layout Optimization</h3><p>We re-align content for readability &mdash; logos, names, tags, buttons, and metadata are reorganized for clarity and conversion.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/686269e5eb1f02e0b210727e6c2e29df11a47715.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 368.16px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"db3bed00 a913 495e a4e2 124866af4b31\" width=\"1920\" height=\"930\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h3>How It Helps Visitors</h3><ul><li><strong>Makes Comparison Easy:</strong> Icons and highlights speed up decision-making</li><li><strong>Saves Time:</strong> No need to open every profile&mdash;key info is visible at a glance</li><li><strong>Inspires Confidence:</strong> Badges, ratings, and structured details feel trustworthy</li><li><strong>Boosts Interaction:</strong> Clear buttons + visual design = more clicks and contact</li></ul><h3>How It Helps Members</h3><ul><li><strong>Increased Visibility:&nbsp;</strong>Appear more professional, trustworthy, and engaging</li><li><strong>Higher Engagement:</strong> More profile visits, messages, and conversions</li><li><strong>Professional First Look:</strong> Listings feel like profiles, not placeholders</li><li><strong>Lead Boost:&nbsp;</strong>Stronger card = better clickthrough = more leads</li></ul><h3>How It Helps Site Owner</h3><ul><li><strong>Modern Directory UI:</strong> Give your site a premium feel, even without changing themes</li><li><strong>Feature Monetization:</strong> Charge members for access to enhanced display cards</li><li><strong>Better UX Metrics:</strong> Lower bounce, higher clicks, and increased time on site</li><li><strong>Stronger SEO Signals:&nbsp;</strong>No more repeated content = better Google indexing</li></ul><hr><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Starts From: $95</strong> &mdash; covers adding up to three enhanced elements to your search result cards (e.g., badges, feature icons, CTA button improvements, or ratings block) with clean styling and responsive alignment.<br>If your request includes additional elements, custom logic, complex designs, or layout restructuring, you&rsquo;ll receive a quote for the price difference, and work begins only after your approval.</p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Membership-level or category-based conditional logic card design</li><li>Animated card elements or advanced hover effects</li><li>Full card redesign (multi-column, multi-section, or multi-row layouts)</li><li>Separate mobile-optimized card version</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests&nbsp;</strong>(if any) are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval..</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:<br></strong>Implementation plan<br>Estimated delivery timeline<br>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</p><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><h2>Transform Your Search Results Into Conversion Machines</h2><p>Your directory shouldn&rsquo;t just show listings &mdash; it should sell them.<br>Give your members richer visibility, give visitors more confidence, and give yourself higher engagement.</p><p>Click &ldquo;<strong>Order Now</strong>&rdquo; and turn every search card into a lead-gen engine.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'b202dda1a93de534e545e7eedf2f273e', 'solutions/enhanced-member-card-elements-in-search-results', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 95.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Member Card', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(583, 101, 'Custom Join Page Development', '<p><strong>From Cluttered to Clear &mdash; Turn Visitors into Members with a High-Converting Join Page.</strong></p><p>Your <strong>join page</strong> is one of the most important parts of your directory. It&rsquo;s where visitors decide whether to <strong>become members &mdash; or leave.</strong></p><p>We design and build <strong>custom join pages</strong> that clearly present your <strong>membership levels</strong>, showcase value, and guide users to take action &mdash; built to <strong>convert, impress, and perform</strong> on Brilliant Directories.</p><hr class=\"cc-divider\"><p>[widget=custom_themes_section_design]</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'a68c9c4ac16ae5254aebc0beca7a061d', 'solutions/custom-join-page-development', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'starts_from', 'service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Join Page Dev', 'Join Page Dev', 'fully_custom', ' ', 50.00, 'deposit'),
(584, 101, 'Custom How it Works Page Development', '<p><strong>From Confusing to Compelling &mdash; Explain Your Directory&rsquo;s Value with Clarity and Confidence.</strong></p><p>Your <strong>&ldquo;How It Works&rdquo; page</strong> is where curiosity turns into understanding &mdash; and understanding turns into action.</p><p>We design and build <strong>engaging, easy-to-follow pages</strong> that explain your directory&rsquo;s <strong>process, benefits, and unique value</strong> in a way that <strong>builds trust</strong> and <strong>drives conversions</strong> &mdash; crafted to inform, impress, and perform on Brilliant Directories.</p><hr class=\"cc-divider\"><p>[widget=custom_themes_section_design]</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, '4e27abbade36bad136ddb955ba8ba03e', 'solutions/custom-how-it-works-page-development', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 99.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'starts_from', 'service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'How It Works Dev', 'How It Works Dev', 'fully_custom', ' ', 50.00, 'deposit'),
(585, 101, 'Custom Page Development as per your Idea', '<p><strong>From Concept to Completion &mdash; Build Any Page You Imagine, Exactly the Way You Want.</strong></p><p>Not every idea fits into a standard feature or layout &mdash; and that&rsquo;s where our <strong>Custom Page Development</strong> service comes in.</p><p>We design and develop <strong>fully customized pages</strong> for Brilliant Directories, tailored to your unique goals &mdash; whether it&rsquo;s a <strong>marketing page, feature extension</strong>, or a <strong>fully dynamic content experience</strong> &mdash; built to integrate perfectly with your site&rsquo;s <strong>design, flow, and functionality.</strong></p><hr class=\"cc-divider\"><p>[widget=custom_themes_section_design]</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033220', '', 0, 'e741ae8652fce204181485847cb15467', 'solutions/custom-page-development-as-per-your-idea', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Custom Page Development', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'starts_from', 'service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Page Development', 'Page Development', 'fully_custom', ' ', 50.00, 'deposit'),
(586, 101, 'Calendly Integration for Members Profile Page', '<p><strong>Let Visitors Instantly Book Meetings with Your Members</strong></p><p>Allow visitors to schedule meetings directly with your members through their profile pages&mdash;no back-and-forth emails, no delays.<br>We embed each member&rsquo;s unique Calendly calendar into their profile or display a call-to-action button like <strong>&ldquo;Book a Call&rdquo;</strong>, which opens their Calendly in a popup or new tab.</p><hr><h2>Why It Matters</h2><h3>Today&rsquo;s users want instant booking&mdash;especially for:</h3><ul><li>Coaches, consultants, and tutors</li><li>Real estate agents or lawyers</li><li>Wellness professionals (therapists, dietitians, etc.)</li><li>Service providers who offer discovery calls</li></ul><p>If your members take appointments, this integration helps them convert profile visits into booked meetings&mdash;automatically.</p><hr><h2>What&rsquo;s Included</h2><ul><li>Calendly embed on member profile pages (popup or inline)</li><li>Personalized Calendly link support per member</li><li>Mobile-friendly calendar integration</li><li>Show only for specific membership plans (optional)</li><li>Optional: Replace &ldquo;Send Message&rdquo; button with &ldquo;Book Appointment&rdquo;</li></ul><hr><h2>Types of Integration Options</h2><p><strong>Option 1: Button Integration (with popup)</strong><br>Display a &ldquo;Book Now&rdquo; button on the profile that opens Calendly in a pop-up or new tab.<br><img src=\"/images/solutions/994020f06594964bbe0a9f7e62b25832089b6b4b.png\" style=\"width: 742px; height: 311.69px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"b2c1a821 3ce6 46c6 bc41 1c549d04deb7\" width=\"742\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"312\"></p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/c78eb85eb15dcbfcc6535e164d750b6242f44a0d.png\" style=\"width: 718px; height: 488.652px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"6f653cba 26ca 4e7c ba2f ded0f598330c\" width=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"489\"></p><p><br><strong>Option 2: Inline Embed</strong><br>Embed the entire Calendly calendar directly inside the profile layout for seamless access.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/326c20c2b0f017482b5c7d0b638ce92ad01ae600.png\" style=\"width: 714px; height: 483.14px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"m3r175fKLz8vI6ZyDAAIIIPAvFyCYtDeYYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7AYJJ9z0IsgKCySDbRtEIIIAAAgh4L0Aw6X2LKBABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQcCpAMGnnJ5i0 zDqXoBg0n0PgqyAYDLItlE0AggggAAC3gsQTHrfIgpEAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBJwKEEza Qkm7T6MuhcgmHTfgyArIJgMsm0UjQACCCCAgPcCBJPet4gCEUAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAGnAgSTdn6CSbsPo 4FCCbd9yDICggmg2wbRSOAAAIIIOC9AMGk9y2iQAQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEDAqQDBpJ2fYNLuw6h7gf8HmHTTbp44t9UAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" width=\"714\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"483\"></p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Members input their Calendly URL in a designated custom field on their dashboard<br><strong>Step 2:&nbsp;</strong>We embed the calendar or booking button on the member&#39;s profile<br><strong>Step 3:&nbsp;</strong>When a visitor clicks, they can book immediately without leaving the site</p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Members:</h3><ul><li>Get more qualified leads</li><li>Save time with automated scheduling</li><li>Reduce no-shows with reminders via Calendly</li></ul><h2>For Visitors:</h2><ul><li>Book appointments without calling or waiting</li><li>See available times instantly</li><li>Get confirmation &amp; reminders automatically</li></ul><h3>For Directory Owners:</h3><ul><li>Increase member value</li><li>Attract higher-tier members with premium features</li><li>Differentiate your directory with a modern, frictionless experience</li></ul><hr><div class=\"calendly-price-clarity\"><h2>Price Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $50</strong> &mdash; covers embedding each member&rsquo;s Calendly scheduler on their profile page (inline or popup), adding a &ldquo;Book Now&rdquo; button, and supporting member-specific Calendly URLs.</p><p>If your setup requires conditional logic, custom UI, or deeper integration, you&rsquo;ll receive a quote for the price difference, and work begins only after your approval.</p><p><strong>Depending on your needs, we might suggest a different CRM solution that&rsquo;s a better fit.<br></strong></p><h4>When Additional Charges Apply:</h4><ul><li>Showing Calendly only for specific plans, categories, or member types</li><li>Replacing default BD buttons (e.g., swapping &ldquo;Send Message&rdquo; with &ldquo;Book Appointment&rdquo;)</li><li>Advanced styling or custom placement within the profile layout</li><li>Mobile-specific behavior or alternate layouts</li></ul></div><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests (if any)&nbsp;</strong>are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h3>Let your members take bookings without friction.</h3><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to enable Calendly scheduling on profile pages.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '7604f6cedbf30d0aba6df5066c84a6a0', 'solutions/calendly-integration-for-members-profile-page', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Integrations', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 50.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' ');
