(587, 101, 'Search Results Sidebar Call-To-Actions', '<p><strong>Convert Visitors into Leads &mdash; Without Interrupting the Results</strong></p><p>Your search results page receives some of the highest traffic on your site &mdash; but most directories fail to convert that attention into action.<br>This service adds one dedicated CTA section inside your search results sidebar, giving visitors a clear next step while they browse.<br><br>Whether they find the right listing or not, they now have a simple, visible way to submit a requirement, request a quote, or reach out.<br>You turn passive browsers into real, qualified leads &mdash; without disrupting their experience.</p><hr><h2>Why It&rsquo;s Important</h2><p>Most visitors scroll through listings, feel uncertain, and leave.<br>A strategic CTA in the sidebar eliminates this dead-end.</p><h3>With a sidebar CTA:</h3><ul><li>Your directory guides visitors toward the action you want</li><li>Users don&rsquo;t need to search for a &ldquo;contact&rdquo; or &ldquo;help me choose&rdquo; option</li><li>Even zero-results pages become conversion opportunities</li><li>Every search page becomes a lead-generation asset</li></ul><p>This is high-impact UX with minimal intrusion &mdash; subtle, helpful, effective.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p>You define the CTA message, button style, and destination (e.g., lead form, join page, booking calendar).<br>We design a sidebar block that fits within your existing layout &mdash; either sticky or static &mdash; that shows on all or specific search result pages.</p><h3>What you provide:</h3><ul><li>A short headline + description</li><li>One or more CTA buttons</li><li>Optional icons or lead form</li><li>Image if any</li></ul><hr><h2>Example</h2><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/43f1b5be5dd386ef9991654adb4926ce203a7aed.png\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1227\" id=\"isPasted\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" alt=\"yh5WO8AAAAGSURBVAMAx15h3iZXG14AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors:</h3><ul><li>Provides a quick, visible way to take action.</li><li>Reduces confusion or friction when unsure who to contact.</li><li>Stays visible as they scroll through listings.</li></ul><h3>For Members:</h3><ul><li>Generates more inquiries by guiding uncertain visitors to submit needs.</li><li>Helps connect them to ready-to-hire customers.</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners:</h3><ul><li>Increases conversions from casual browsers.</li><li>Works even when there are no matching listings.</li><li>Offers subtle but effective lead generation without clutter.</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><h3>Ready to capture leads directly from your search results sidebar?</h3><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> and start converting traffic into inquiries &mdash; without interrupting their browsing experience.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '60494e029e4b006b830c5c691c481259', 'solutions/search-results-sidebar-call-to-actions', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 50.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Search Results Sidebar CTA ', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(588, 101, 'Quick Directory Review', '<p><strong>A short, actionable expert review to help you take your Brilliant Directories site from &quot;just launched&quot; to confidently set up.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Quick Directory Review</strong> is a fast, practical review for Brilliant Directories site owners who want expert eyes on their setup before launching, relaunching, or promoting their site. You&rsquo;ll receive personalized video(s) and a PDF summary with a curated list of suggestions and quick wins that can improve member experience, conversion flow, and trust and polish.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ready for expert feedback? Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; to get started.</blockquote><hr><h2>What Is the Quick Directory Review?</h2><p>This is a fast, practical review for Brilliant Directories site owners who want expert eyes on their setup before launching, relaunching, or promoting their site.</p><p>You&rsquo;ll receive personalized video(s) + a PDF summary with a curated list of suggestions and quick wins that can improve:</p><ul><li>Member experience</li><li>Conversion flow</li><li>Trust and polish</li></ul><p>This is NOT a redesign, or NOT a full strategy consultation, and is NOT an advanced custom work.<br><strong>It&rsquo;s a fast checkup from people who worked with launches that made success.</strong></p><hr><h2>Who Benefits Most from This Review?</h2><ul><li>You just launched your Brilliant Directories site (or are about to), and want a pair of eyes before showing the world</li><li>You&rsquo;ve had your site live for a while, but something feels... off &mdash; and you&#39;re not sure what</li><li>You&#39;re on a budget or timeline and need focused, few priority quick-wins as feedback without weeks of back-and-forth</li><li>You want to make sure your navigation makes sense, your forms work, and your sign-up flow isn&rsquo;t scaring people away</li></ul><p><strong>Basically:</strong> You built the thing &mdash; now you want to know if it makes sense to people who weren&rsquo;t inside your head while building it.</p><hr><h2>Who This Is Not For</h2><ul><li>You&rsquo;ve got a heavily customized BD site with third-party tools, custom scripts, or developer-dependent workflows</li><li>You&#39;re expecting a full marketing strategy, UX level fine tuning, or product roadmap &mdash; this is a checkup, not a bootcamp</li><li>You&#39;re deep into custom member flows, logic-based pricing models, or automations (that&rsquo;s Advanced Review territory)</li></ul><p><strong>If your site has more logic than a sci-fi script, we love that &mdash; but we&rsquo;ll need to use the Advanced Review for that level of complexity. For an intense review, check out:&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/tools/advanced-directory-review\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Advanced Directory Review.</strong></a></p><hr><h2>What&rsquo;s Included in the Quick Directory Review</h2><ul><li>PDF summary checklist of key points &amp; recommendations</li><li>Personalized one or more videos, walkthrough reviewing:<ul><li>Home page</li><li>Signup flow (Join page, Pricing, checkout page)</li><li>Navigation</li><li>Members dashboard</li><li>Key forms feedback</li><li>Member search results page</li><li>Member detail page</li><li>Main focused post type search results page (One post type)</li><li>Focused post type&#39;s detail listing page</li></ul></li><li>3&ndash;5 quick wins you can apply today</li><li>Light touch, fast feedback</li></ul><p><strong>Bonus:</strong> If any part of your site needs its own separate walkthrough (e.g., member dashboard or listing form), we include that in a second mini-video. No extra cost.</p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Thinking About the Advanced Review Instead?</h2><table style=\"overflow: hidden; width: 98%; max-width: 900px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);  text-align: center;\"><thead><tr><th style=\'font-family: \"Kumbh Sans\", sans-serif; padding: 10