rm, or aggressively increase revenue<br></td></tr><tr><td style=\'font-family: \"Kumbh Sans\", sans-serif; padding: 10px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 28.5239%;\'><strong>Investment</strong><br></td><td style=\'font-family: \"Kumbh Sans\", sans-serif; padding: 10px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 37.3379%; background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255);\'><strong>$250</strong><br></td><td style=\'font-family: \"Kumbh Sans\", sans-serif; padding: 16px 24px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 33.9387%;\'><strong>$1500</strong><br></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #d319e6; padding:10px 15px; background:#fff7ff;\"><p><strong>Note:</strong><br>If you simply need actionable direction without a big commitment, this Quick Directory Review is the smartest starting step.</p></div><hr><h2><strong>How the Quick Directory Review Helps</strong></h2><p>You get expert eyes on your Brilliant Directories setup &mdash; fast. This review helps identify friction points, UX gaps, and overlooked tweaks that can unlock better results.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>Here&rsquo;s what it does for you:</strong></p><ul><li>Shows you what&rsquo;s working (and what&rsquo;s not)</li><li>Flags confusing or broken flows before users bounce</li><li>Gives you quick-wins / suggestions without the fluff, you can improvise today</li><li>Keeps you moving forward &mdash; no wheel-spinning</li></ul><p>You&rsquo;ll leave with clarity, direction, and a quick list you can start on today &mdash; no second-guessing needed.</p><hr><h2>Good for Your Members &amp; Users Too</h2><p>It&rsquo;s not just about how your site looks to you.&nbsp;</p><p>This review focuses on what your members and visitors experience &mdash; because they&rsquo;re the ones who matter most.</p><ul><li>Easier onboarding means more completed signups</li><li>Clearer pricing and CTAs mean less confusion</li><li>Faster navigation = better user satisfaction</li><li>Fixing friction makes people stay longer (and come back)</li></ul><p>A smoother, simpler, more trustworthy experience helps your site grow &mdash; and makes it something people actually want to use and share.</p><hr><h2>Ready to Start?</h2><p>Ready for quick and focused feedback? Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to get started.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '0b838797a7c6250b7e375657d8846fc8', 'solutions/quick-directory-review', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Consultation', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Review Quick', 'Review Quick', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(589, 101, 'Advanced Directory Review', '<p><strong>The Advanced Directory Review: Scale Your Brilliant Directories Site with Expert Precision.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ready to move beyond guessing and start growing?</blockquote><p>This isn&#39;t just a review&mdash;it&#39;s a comprehensive, strategic blueprint for <strong>Brilliant Directories founders</strong> serious about scaling, maximizing visibility, and achieving serious traction.</p><p><strong>What You Get:</strong> A full expert walkthrough and strategic guidance designed to make your site better, faster, and smarter.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>Perfect for Founders Who Are:</strong></p><ul><li>Already earning revenue or have strong early traction.</li><li>Ready to invest strategically before scaling.</li><li>Committed to turning a great concept into a dominant market leader.</li></ul><hr><h2>Advanced Directory Review &mdash; For Founders Ready to Scale</h2><p>Your directory is live or nearly there, and you&#39;re ready for real growth. You know it needs more than just good looks&mdash;it needs clarity, structure, and a clear path to monetization.<br><br>The Advanced Review is a full expert walkthrough and strategic guidance to make your site better, faster, and smarter. Stop guessing and start growing.</p><h3>✔️ Who This Is For:</h3><ul><li>Your directory has strong traction or is already earning.</li><li>You believe your idea has six-figure potential and want to scale correctly.</li><li>You are ready to invest seriously ($1500 + tools/design/dev tweaks) for expert insight.</li><li>You want a detailed, opinionated, custom, and strategic walkthrough&mdash;not generic tips.</li><li>You&#39;re preparing for ads, SEO, outreach, or funding and need your site to convert.</li></ul><h3>❌ Who This Is Not For:</h3><ul><li>You are just starting out and haven&#39;t validated your idea.</li><li>You are unsure about investing &gt;$3K right now.</li><li>You primarily seek design polish (this goes much deeper).</li><li>You want ongoing coaching or implementation help (this is a one-time deep dive).</li></ul><p>(Just need a fast checkup? Try our <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/tools/quick-directory-review\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Quick Directory Review.</a>)</p><hr><h2>What You Get: Advanced Directory Review</h2><ul><li><strong>15-Minute Setup Call (Required):</strong> Understand your goals, blockers, and get admin access.</li><li><strong>(Optional) 2&times;60-Minute Zoom Walkthroughs:</strong> Live walkthrough of the review, section by section. (Highly recommended.)</li><li><strong>Full Multi-Part Video Review (60&ndash;90 minutes):</strong>Personalized, deep-dive walkthroughs broken into clear sections:<ul><li>Homepage, navigation, and join flow</li><li>Member signup and profile UX</li><li>Key post types (listings/events/etc.)</li><li>Search logic and category structure</li><li>CTAs, upsells, email flow, and monetization</li><li>Friction points and missed opportunities</li></ul></li><li><strong>PDF Summary with Visual Notes:</strong> Clear action points, screenshots, and strategic notes.</li><li><strong>Monetization Suggestions:</strong> Smart monetization ideas based on your site&#39;s structure and goals.</li><li><strong>Multiple High-Leverage Suggestions:</strong> We cover everything to maximize value for your investment.</li></ul><hr><h2>Why It&rsquo;s Worth It&nbsp;</h2><p>You believe your idea is valuable. You&rsquo;ve already put time and money into it. The Advanced Directory Review gives you high-level clarity before scaling or spending more.</p><ul><li>Save months of wheel-spinning</li><li>Fix things before users bounce</li><li>Feel confident in your flow, messaging, and offer</li><li>Stop tweaking blindly and start acting strategically</li></ul><hr><h2>What We Don&rsquo;t Do (Important)</h2><ul><li>We don&rsquo;t implement the changes &mdash; this is an audit, not execution.</li><li>We don&rsquo;t work with heavily custom-coded sites (but we&rsquo;ll flag concerns).</li><li>We don&rsquo;t offer support for external tools or apps &mdash; but will make recommendations.</li></ul><p>You get insight. Direction. Strategy. Confidence. And clarity.</p><hr><h2>Let&rsquo;s compare Quick vs. Advanced Review?</h2><table style=\"overflow: hidden; width: 98%; max-width: 900px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);  text-align: center;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: rgb(247, 249, 252); text-align: center;\">Feature</th><th style=\"background-color: rgb(247, 249, 252); text-align: center; width: 33.0151%;\">Quick Directory Review</th><th style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255); text-align: center; width: 39.1923%;\">Advanced Directory Review<br>(This Very Service)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;padding: 10px;border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Strategy Guidance</td><td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 33.0151%;\">Light suggestions for immediate fixes</td><td style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); text-align: center; padding: 10px; width: 39.1923%;\">Deep Consultation + Monetization Strategy</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;padding: 10px;border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Level of Actionability</td><td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 33.0151%;\">Quick: Immediate, Low-Effort Fixes</td><td style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255); text-align: center; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 39.1923%;\"><strong>Advanced:&nbsp;</strong>Strategic Roadmap for 2-4 Months</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;padding: 10px;border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);\">Areas Covered</td><td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 33.0151%;\">Core pages, flows</td><td style=\"background-color: 