151%;\"><strong>$250</strong></td><td style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 247, 255); text-align: center; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); width: 39.1923%;\"><strong>$1500</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #d319e6; padding:10px 15px; background:#fff7ff;\"><p><strong>Note:</strong></p><p>To get the most out of the Advanced Directory Review service, we recommend budgeting for at least $3K, even though our service fee is $1500. This is so you have the necessary budget to immediately action the key insights.</p><p>If you are not in a position to execute these next steps right away, either if you wish to launch lean, or want to just test waters &mdash; the <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/tools/quick-directory-review\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Quick Directory Review</a> may be a more meaningful starting point.</p></div><hr><h2>Ready to transform your six-figure idea into reality?</h2><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px;\">This is for founders who are ready to go pro &mdash; and want their BD site to reflect it.</blockquote><h3>Deliverables Recap</h3><ul><li>15-min setup Zoom call</li><li>2&times;60-min optional walkthrough sessions</li><li>Multiple focused video reviews (totaling 60&ndash;90 minutes)</li><li>PDF summary with visual notes</li><li>Monetization suggestions + flow fixes</li><li>Strategic action plan &mdash; no fluff</li></ul><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to get started.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '3a8cc079ec6fbffbf70227387ae12778', 'solutions/advanced-directory-review', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Consultation', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 1500.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'flagship_service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Review Advanced', 'Review Advanced', 'fully_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(590, 101, 'Latest Reviews on Search Results', '<p><strong>Display Recent Member Reviews Directly Inside Search Results Cards</strong></p><p>This feature adds a &ldquo;Latest Review&rdquo; snippet to each member search result card, allowing visitors to preview the last review received by a business.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">Don&rsquo;t make users click to find out if someone is trusted &mdash; show them right away.</blockquote><hr><h2>The review preview includes:</h2><ul><li>The most recent review&#39;s comment (trimmed for space)</li><li>Reviewer&rsquo;s first name or initials (optional)</li><li>Star rating (if ratings are enabled)</li></ul><p>The data is pulled dynamically from the member&#39;s review history &mdash; no manual input required.<br>If no review exists, the section doesn&rsquo;t appear for that member.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><ul><li><strong>We customize your member search card</strong><br>Add a review display block below the name/title</li><li><strong>UI/UX Finalization and Implementation</strong><br>We will show you a few design options or can take your preferred design.</li><li><strong>Pull the latest review using BD&rsquo;s database<br></strong>Auto-display the newest review content + rating</li><li><strong>Display conditionally&nbsp;<br></strong> If no review is present, the space is hidden to preserve the layout</li></ul><hr><h2>See It In Action</h2><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/99248c57454e34687414f107289f9d54eefecde6.png\" style=\"width: 629px; height: 320.79px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"c6ad3078 881d 417c 880e 240232db8c62\" width=\"1600\" height=\"819\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors:</h3><ul><li>See real feedback instantly</li><li>Without needing to open each profile one by one</li><li>Compare listings quickly</li><li>Latest reviews give a helpful preview of quality</li></ul><h3>For Members:</h3><ul><li>Showcase latest feedback</li><li>Positive reviews help generate more leads and conversions</li><li>No extra setup &mdash; tool works with existing BD reviews system</li></ul><h3>For Directory Owners:</h3><ul><li>Increase engagement with results pages</li><li>More time spent on listings = better lead quality</li><li>Reward active members &mdash; those receiving reviews get visual boost automatically</li><li>Make your directory look alive &mdash; fresh content on results pages builds credibility</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within&nbsp;<strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash;<br>such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Add Live Social Proof to Your Search Experience</h2><p>Don&rsquo;t make users click to find out if someone is trusted &mdash; show them right away. <strong>Order Now!</strong></p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '809daf5f666414c7acb90920d69b25c2', 'solutions/latest-reviews-on-search-results', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 145.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Latest Reviews', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(591, 101, 'Table of contents or index for articles', '<p><strong>Bring structure. Improve clarity. Keep users reading longer.</strong></p><p>Long articles can overwhelm readers &mdash; they scroll, get lost, and exit.</p><p>This tool fixes that by adding a <strong>clickable Table of Contents (TOC)</strong> to every article.</p><p>Readers can <strong>scan, skip, and jump</strong> to what matters &mdash; instantly.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">Turn long articles into scannable, high&ndash;retention content with a <strong>smart, clickable Table of Contents.</strong></blockquote><hr><h2>See it Action</h2><p>Right below the title of your article (or below the Cover image if you have uploaded one),<br>aka. right above the body content of your article,<br>you have a <strong>Table of Content</strong> giving a complete glimpse to your readers what all you got in this article.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/551b52131a51ec5b78ed36077f834a7ded0e39ae.png\" width=\"757\" style=\"width: 757px; height: 477.132px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" alt=\"oxfDKAAAABklEQVQDANimqR2UtLCzAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"477\"></p><p>As your readers click on any item in the table of contents, they are automatically scrolled to that area, see it in action here:</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/tableofcontents.gif?tr=w-390,f-webp,q-75\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"3eb116d6 2861 4329 91ee 67a53c0c4da0\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>How it Works</h2><p>This feature automatically detects headings (H2/H3/H4) inside the article and generates a <strong>Table of Contents</strong> at the top of the page.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">It enables:</p><ul><li>Instant page navigation</li><li>Smooth scroll animations</li><li>Custom styled TOC matching your site&rsquo;s colors specified in &lsquo;Design Settings&rsquo;</li></ul><p>Visitors get clarity, members look professional, and your directory benefits from <strong>better SEO + higher engagement.</strong></p><h2>5 Key Features</h2><ul><li>Auto-generated or manual Table of Contents</li><li>Table of Contents positioned at the top of each article for instant visibility</li><li>Smooth scrolling for easy navigation</li><li>Colors matched to your brand identity</li><li>Works seamlessly across all articles</li></ul><h3>Optional Enhancements are also possible (Priced Extra)</h3><ul><li>Custom designed Table of Contents</li><li>Collapsible Design</li><li>Floating sidebar mode</li><li>Or, anything that you might have seen online on some website</li></ul><p>However, what you see in the Image and GIFs above, is what you get for no extra costs.</p><h2>How It Helps Visitors</h2><ul><li>Quickly scan articles and jump to relevant sections</li><li>Save time by going to what they need right now</li><li>Stay longer on well-structured, easy-to-navigate pages</li></ul><h2>How It Helps Members</h2><ul><li>Improves the professional look of published content</li><li>Adds more clarity and credibility to article contributions</li><li>Boosts engagement and readability for member posts</li></ul><h2>How It Helps Site Owners</h2><ul><li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Enhances SEO with structured in-page navigation</strong></li><li><strong>Reduces bounce rates</strong> on content-heavy pages</li><li>Encourages deeper content exploration and user retention</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit few details</strong><br>Enter your name, email, website URL, and any required details to proceed with the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm your Order</strong><br>Once payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no approval or meeting is needed for this plugin/service.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Communication &amp; Installation Instructions</strong><br>You&rsquo;ll hear from us within <strong>2 business days&nbsp;</strong>(usually under 24hours).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>We&rsquo;ll send:</strong></p><ul><li>Installation steps &mdash; you can do it yourself, and</li><li>Any additional questions only if required (e.g., clarification depending on the nature of plugin/service, or admin access if you requested our help with implementation).</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Installation &ndash; You Choose Who Does It</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You can either:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Install it yourself&nbsp;</strong>using the guide we provide, or</li><li><strong>Ask our team to install it for you</strong> at no extra cost.</li></ul><hr><h2>Ready to make your articles easier to navigate?</h2><p>Click <strong>&quot;Order Now&quot;</strong> to get your Article Index feature added today.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, 'f66cfb570423776753f0bfecf12ae588', 'solutions/table-of-contents-or-index-for-articles', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Article Index', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(592, 101, 'Elevator Pitch Manager for Blog Articles', '<p><strong>Contextual Pitches Assigned to Every Post</strong></p><p>The <strong>Elevator Pitch Manager</strong> allows admins to create short, impactful messages that can be displayed at the bottom of article detailed pages.&nbsp;</p><p>These messages are not tied to the article&rsquo;s content but serve as strategic, attention-grabbing summaries or promotional highlights chosen by the admin to engage readers or guide them toward the next action.</p><p><strong>Very Specific Pitch with CTA on specific articles, on demand, that too, easy to apply.</strong><br>Apply a specific Pitch on 14 out of 100 articles, and that too no-code.</p><hr><h2>What Is an Elevator Pitch?</h2><p>An Elevator Pitch is a concise, one-to-two-line message designed to quickly communicate a key idea or call-to-action.&nbsp;</p><p>It&rsquo;s meant to &ldquo;hook&rdquo; readers in seconds &mdash; much like how you would explain something important in the short time of an elevator ride.</p><p>&nbsp;In this context, it helps you make your website pages more engaging and purposeful by adding short, meaningful statements that leave a lasting impression.</p><hr><h2>What This Elevator Pitch Does</h2><p>This tool lets the admin add, edit, and manage multiple elevator pitches directly from the plugin.&nbsp;</p><p>Each pitch can then be assigned to one or more article detail pages, with just a click. This gives full control over which message appears on which article &mdash; ensuring you can tailor engagement and calls-to-action across your content.</p><ul><li>✅ Admin can create new elevator pitches from the plugin dashboard.</li><li>✅ Easily assign different pitches to different articles.</li><li>✅ Display selected pitches at the bottom of article detail pages.</li><li>✅ Update, replace, or remove any pitch anytime without editing the article itself.</li></ul><hr><h2>Advantages</h2><ul><li>✅ Create impactful promotional messages managed directly from the plugin.</li><li>✅ Encourage conversions through short, strategic summaries.</li><li>✅ Assign different pitches to different posts for tailored engagement.</li><li>✅ Keep pages dynamic and relevant with easy plugin management.</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Quickly understand key messages at the end of each article.</li><li>Stay engaged with thoughtful prompts or calls-to-action.</li><li>Enjoy a more polished and interactive reading experience.</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners / Admin</h3><ul><li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Precise Pitch Presented on Precise Articles.</strong></li><li>Your How to Lose 5 Pounds Article is read till the end by someone who actually wants to lose pounds, and think, Join a Gym or Yoga Class Pitch made there.</li><li>Similarly, &ldquo;<strong>List your GYM or Yoga Class</strong>&rdquo; pitch made on an article where you were helping the Gym owner, like an article on &ldquo;<strong>How to get first 100 clients for your Gym.</strong>&rdquo;</li><li>Promote events, offers, or announcements sitewide or per post.</li><li>Enhance engagement and conversions through consistent messaging.</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Admin accesses the Elevator Pitch Manager plugin in the admin panel.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/76fc94ca3da0de22516b6feeab179e8a4d6c5e88.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"3eb116d6 2861 4329 91ee 67a53c0c4da0\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Creates new elevator pitches or edits existing ones with custom titles and content.<br><img src=\"/images/solutions/bd3af35a93ff516e7afa41b1b477923cc672e117.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.784px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"d9d260bd 6115 419d 8c87 f23248aeadec\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"430\"></p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Assign the created pitch to specific article detail pages (using a simple dropdown menu in the article editor).<br><img src=\"/images/solutions/adding_elevator_pitchssew.gif?tr=w-390,f-webp,q-75\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.191px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"84a6d5f8 f885 4e50 b96f 0046bfa18ec3\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"429\"></p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong> The selected elevator pitch appears automatically at the bottom of that article detail page.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/optimise.gif?tr=w-390,f-webp,q-75\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"27c941ac b6b3 40ee bc2e ee2b1aed41ce\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Note:</strong> Admin can also assign/replace the pitch anytime by editing the post. Everything is dynamic.</blockquote><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit few details</strong><br>Enter your name, email, website URL, and any required details to proceed with the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm your Order</strong><br>Once payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no approval or meeting is needed for this plugin/service.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Communication &amp; Installation Instructions</strong><br>You&rsquo;ll hear from us within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually under 24hours).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>We&rsquo;ll send:</strong></p><ul><li>Installation steps &mdash; you can do it yourself, and</li><li>Any additional questions only if required (e.g., clarification depending on the nature of plugin/service, or admin access if you requested our help with implementation).</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Installation &ndash; You Choose Who Does It</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>You can either:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>I</strong><strong>nstall it yourself</strong> using the guide we provide, or</li><li><strong>Ask our team to install it for you</strong> at no extra cost.</li></ul><hr><h2>Make Every Article End with Impact</h2><p>Click &quot;<strong>Order Now</strong>&quot; to activate the <strong>Elevator Pitch Manager</strong> and start adding powerful, attention-grabbing messages to your article pages.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '73792eec022899033f521cd1d4f261f5', 'solutions/elevator-pitch-manager-for-blog-articles', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Pitch Manager', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' ');
INSERT INTO `users_portfolio_groups` (`group_id`, `user_id`, `group_name`, `group_desc`, `group_location`, `group_date`, `date_updated`, `reference_url`, `group_order`, `group_token`, `group_filename`, `group_status`, `structure_id`, `facebook_id`, `additional_fields`, `group_type`, `data_type`, `data_id`, `group_category`, `revision_timestamp`, `lat`, `lon`, `post_tags`, `upload_image_slide`, `post_review`, `property_status`, `property_type`, `reference_url_idea`, `property_price`, `annual_price`, `property_beds`, `property_baths`, `property_sqr_foot`, `sticky_post`, `post_location`, `sticky_post_expiration_date`, `country_sn`, `state_sn`, `revision_count`, `post_excerpt`, `price_unit`, `product_type`, `price_duration`, `widget_name`, `delivery_time_title`, `delivery_time_description`, `warranty_time_title`, `description_time_description`, `demo_video`, `short_title`, `short_title_for_results`, `implementation_type`, `tool_subscription_type`, `commitment_price`, `starts_from_type`) VALUES
(593, 101, 'Edit Post URLs for Brilliant Directories', '<p><strong>Take Full Control of Your Post URLs for Better SEO &amp; Branding</strong></p><p>The <strong>Edit Post URLs Tool</strong> lets admins manually edit and manage the URL (slug) of any post &mdash; including <strong>Articles, Jobs, Properties, Events, Classifieds</strong><strong>, or any custom post type</strong> &mdash; directly from the admin panel.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">Enhance SEO performance and align your directory&rsquo;s content with your brand.</blockquote><p>Whether you want to optimize for SEO, add target keywords, or clean up auto-generated slugs, this gives you complete control over how your content appears across the web.</p><hr><h2>What This Tool Does</h2><p>This feature allows you to <strong>manually edit and update post URLs</strong> across all post types on your Brilliant Directories site.</p><ul><li>Create short, keyword-rich, brand-aligned URLs</li><li>Prevent duplicate slugs automatically</li><li>Maintain internal routing and proper redirects</li><li>Improve link trust, readability, and click-through rates</li></ul><p>The result: cleaner, more professional URLs that help with SEO and look great when shared on social media.</p><hr><h2 id=\"isPasted\">See It in Action</h2><p><br></p><p>Admin can edit urls of all posts in every post type from one place.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/editposturl.gif?tr=w-390,f-webp,q-75\" alt=\"c9d86013 c3ae 4baf be70 bce48e19cb84\" width=\"493\" height=\"304.167\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2>Why Add Custom URL Editing to Your BD Site?</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Cleaner, readable URLs &mdash; Easy to trust, click, and remember</li><li>Easier sharing &mdash; Visitors can copy or share article URLs effortlessly</li><li>Better SEO experience &mdash; Human-friendly URLs perform better on search engines</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Improved visibility &mdash; URLs with keywords and names help their content rank better</li><li>Easier sharing &mdash; Members can proudly share short, clean post links</li><li>Professional impression &mdash; Adds credibility to their published content</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners</h3><ul><li>SEO control &mdash; Add focus keywords directly into URLs</li><li>Fix messy slugs &mdash; Clean up long, system-generated URLs</li><li>Brand consistency &mdash; Align blog and post URLs with your site&rsquo;s structure and identity</li></ul><hr><h2>Compatibility</h2><ul><li>Works across all BD post types (Articles, Events, Jobs, Properties, Classifieds, etc.)</li><li>Fully compatible with BD&rsquo;s routing system</li><li>Automatically prevents duplicate slugs</li><li>SEO-safe implementation &mdash; no broken links or conflicts</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit few details</strong><br>Enter your name, email, website URL, and any required details to proceed with the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm your Order</strong><br>Once payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no approval or meeting is needed for this plugin/service.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Communication &amp; Installation Instructions</strong><br>You&rsquo;ll hear from us within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually under 24hours).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>We&rsquo;ll send:</strong></p><ul><li>Installation steps &mdash; you can do it yourself, and</li><li>Any additional questions only if required (e.g., clarification depending on the nature of plugin/service, or admin access if you requested our help with implementation).</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Installation &ndash; You Choose Who Does It</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You can either:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Install it yourself</strong> using the guide we provide, or</li><li><strong>Ask our team to install it for you</strong> at no extra cost.</li></ul><hr><h2>Want SEO-Friendly URLs That Represent Your Content Perfectly?</h2><p>We&rsquo;ll give you full control over every post URL &mdash; clean, keyword-rich, and on-brand.<br>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to enable custom URL editing for all post types on your Brilliant Directories site.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '7613725cc4ebd915d54e26b9c3dd65e6', 'solutions/edit-post-urls-for-brilliant-directories', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 99.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Edit Post URLs ', ' ', 'readytoimplement', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(594, 101, 'Lead Gen on No Search Results Page', '<p><strong>Don&rsquo;t let your best users bounce&mdash;convert them into qualified leads instantly.</strong></p><p>The Lead Gen on No Search Results Page tool intercepts dead-end searches and turns them into lead opportunities. Instead of leaving empty-handed, users are prompted with a simple request form&mdash;&ldquo;Tell us what you&rsquo;re looking for.&rdquo; Each submission becomes a lead in your system, automatically matched to the right member and tracked in your dashboard.</p><p><strong>Your most valuable visitors are slipping away. Turn them into your best leads.</strong></p><hr><h2>What This Service Does</h2><p>When visitors land on a search page with no relevant results, most leave instantly. This service prevents that by keeping users engaged, improving the user experience, and generating high-quality leads. It helps visitors find what they need faster, allows members to get more qualified leads, and helps you, the site owner, capture more leads and boost overall engagement.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> We meet over Zoom to plan your CTA design, copy, and placement.</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> You provide the message/image, OR we help create it for you.</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> We will implement the CTA and it will show up when there are empty results or nothing on the search results.</p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong> Users fill out the form, and members get matched with leads.</p><p><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/0ef9ef1ae428b07f170d8d8176cc384fe24495d0.jpg\" style=\"width: 752px; height: 571.899px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"ebd821e9 569d 413c 984d 372b33441a0e\" width=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"572\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Get more leads automatically</li><li>Better quality inquiries</li><li>Easier follow-up from one dashboard</li></ul><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>No dead ends when results are empty</li><li>One simple form to explain what they need</li><li>Faster help and a smoother experience</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners</h3><ul><li>Lower bounce rate</li><li>More leads &rarr; more revenue</li><li>Useful data about what people are searching for</li><li>You focus on marketing to get members where you already have consumers</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Turn Dead Ends into Conversions</h2><p>Your most valuable visitors are slipping away. Turn them into your best leads.<br>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to add a high-converting Call to Action to your search results.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '31e72ce4c8f603af33be736fa2ad463c', 'solutions/lead-gen-on-no-search-results-page', 1, 0, '', 'Order Now', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 50.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', 'Implementation Time', '1_week', 'Warranty', ' ', ' ', 'No Result Lead', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(595, 101, 'Lead Gen on Search Results Page', '<h2>Capture More Leads Right From the Member Search Results</h2><p>The Lead Gen CTA on Search Results Page tool transforms your search results page into a high-converting lead capture tool. This feature displays bold, eye-catching Call-to-Action (CTA) buttons between member listings to prompt visitors to take action&mdash;submit an inquiry, join a list, request a quote, or book a call.</p><p><strong>Ready to convert more traffic into leads?</strong></p><hr><h2>What This Service Does</h2><p>This service helps you collect more leads from your high-traffic search pages by making it easy for visitors to take the next step without scrolling endlessly. The well-placed, relevant CTAs encourage action, guiding users into funnels like quote requests, contact forms, or newsletter sign-ups. You can customize the messages and links to match your specific business goals.</p><hr><h2>Use Case Examples</h2><ul><li>&ldquo;Need Help Choosing? Submit a Quick Inquiry&rdquo; button after every 5 results.</li><li>&ldquo;Can&rsquo;t Find the Right Match? Let Us Help&rdquo; CTA with a form popup.</li><li>&ldquo;Book a Free Consultation&rdquo; button linking to a Calendly page or lead form.</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> You define the CTA design, text, and link destination (or we help you craft one).</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> We inject the CTA(s) into your search results page, positioned strategically between listings.</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> You start capturing leads while users are actively browsing your directory.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/2e51462cb9c25d1ba508065650a3c51a20d37003.gif\" style=\"width: 752px; height: 400.766px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"edeebedd e4db 4601 9c87 3789d65f9b9b\" width=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"401\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Makes it easy to take the next step without scrolling endlessly.</li><li>Encourages action with well-placed, relevant CTAs.</li><li>Improves user experience with helpful prompts at the right moment.</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Helps generate more leads for listed members.</li><li>Ensures members benefit from visibility even if not clicked directly.</li><li>Increases inquiries for services or profiles within their category.</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners</h3><ul><li>Collect more leads from your high-traffic search pages.</li><li>Guide users into funnels&mdash;quote requests, contact form, join CTA, etc.</li><li>Customize messages and links to match your business goals.</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Ready to convert more traffic into leads?</h2><p>Click<strong>&nbsp;&quot;Order Now&quot;&nbsp;</strong>to activate lead-gen CTAs on your search results page.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '28d783bcc47a763d0c8dd1b0d44e38ee', 'solutions/lead-gen-on-search-results-page', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Lead CTA', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(596, 101, 'Member Profile Tabs Edits', '<p><strong>Strategic refinement of your member profile tabs drives stronger engagement.</strong></p><p><br>Instead of adding new tabs, we refine the ones you already have &mdash; clearer labels, better structure, and positions of tabs that feel relevant to your industry.</p><hr><h2>See what BD default is and what we will do</h2><h3>Some Examples and Use Cases</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">A simple change like switching <strong>&ldquo;Overview&rdquo;</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/e9b74025e577c8346e2280f727eb11a5c1dd8887.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 283.79px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"64d1171f 3ee8 46e4 8e5f 4d485869fcd6\" width=\"1070\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br><strong>to&nbsp;</strong><strong>&ldquo;About Us&rdquo;</strong><strong>.</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/62973dd930e7abc81036d6eea296315da6011168.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 294.017px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"d7aa3c1d beb2 4df0 8d36 53a3103cb8d9\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"294\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">Or, changing the tab name for the Events post type in Real Estate Directories from&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;Events&rdquo;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/e4ebbe4164a7755d25ceb225cd9a530f62550bce.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 232.657px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"49ccc790 4dec 4ba0 83a2 aa6162ec4596\" width=\"1075\" height=\"328\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong><br></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">to&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;Open House&rdquo;</strong> as it&#39;s suitable for the Real Estate Industry.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/cb1ab42d2a82b1f63e34022bd1c30f7700cc7a27.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 232.657px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"0de2ba85 68a6 4166 a53f da6ac3afd7e2\" width=\"1066\" height=\"326\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Or, reordering tabs for a Real Estate Directory like: About Agency, Properties, Open House.</strong></p><p>These micro-tweaks help members present themselves better, help visitors find information faster, and help you maintain cleaner, more consistent profile pages across your directory.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px !important;\"><strong>The result: stronger engagement, smoother navigation, and profiles that actually feel built for your niche.</strong></blockquote><hr><h2>Manage Member Profile Tabs Yourself (DIY)</h2><p>If you like to Do It Yourself (DIY), which just means doing the work yourself, Brilliant Directories has some helpful instructions for you:</p><hr><h3>Manage Your Member Profile Tabs</h3><p>Easily control how member profiles appear on your site.</p><p><strong>Change the Name of Tabs (Title &amp; URL)</strong><br>Customize the name, title, and URL of the tabs that display different types of posts on a member&#39;s profile.</p><p><a href=\"https://bootstrap.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000028489-how-to-change-the-name-tab-title-url-of-a-post-type\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&nbsp;How to Change the Name (Tab Title/URL) of a Post Type&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></p><p><strong>Change the Order of Tabs</strong><br>Adjust the display order of tabs for members based on their specific membership group.</p><p><a href=\"https://bootstrap.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000049272-finance-membership-plans-profile-page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&nbsp;Finance - Membership Plans - Profile Page&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></p><hr><h2>Don&#39;t Have Time or Need Expert Help? Let Us Do It!</h2><p>Doing it yourself is great, but we can save you time and headache. We&#39;ll look at your website, suggest the best way to set up your tabs, and make sure everything is optimized for you right away.</p><p>You&#39;ll get the perfect result without having to learn all the steps first, and you&#39;ll still have full control if you ever want to change things later!</p><div style=\"background:#f9f9f9;border-left:4px solid #E74D56;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0;\"><p style=\"font-size:16px!important;\"><strong>Our Quick Tab Edit Service Starts at Just $20</strong></p><p>For most websites, our $20 service will get the job done!</p><p><strong>This includes:</strong></p><p><strong>Option A:&nbsp;</strong>Changing tab names for up to&nbsp;<strong>3 different post types</strong> (like &quot;Classifieds&quot; or &quot;Coupons&quot;).<br>Or,<br><strong>Option B:</strong> Changing the order of tabs for up to <strong>3 different membership plans.</strong></p><p>This covers about 90% of what most directories need!</p></div><p>If you need changes for more post types or more membership plans, we can send you a separate quote.</p><p><strong>Pay $20 and let&#39;s get started on your initial edit!</strong></p><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>to get started.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '74e65a0c303b94d5223f245e27077c00', 'solutions/member-profile-tabs-edits', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Profile Tabs', 'Member Profile Tabs Edits', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, 'deposit'),
(597, 101, 'Additional Fields on Contact Detail Page', '<p><strong>Collect the right information from the start with custom fields</strong></p><p>You can tailor the basic contact details form to your specific needs by adding <strong>Additional Fields on the Contact Detail Form</strong>. This allows you to immediately capture precise information from members or users, which in turn enhances data quality, improves personalization efforts, and increases the efficiency of your follow-up processes.</p><hr><h2>What This Service Does</h2><p>The Basic Details form is the very first interaction your members have after signing up. It&rsquo;s where they set up their identity. By default, Brilliant Directories captures standard data like name, company, email, phone, short bio, and social links &mdash; but what if you could collect exactly what matters to your niche?</p><p>We offer a planning and consultation service to help you identify and suggest additional fields that are most relevant to your specific niche.</p><p>Once the fields and their order are finalized, we implement these custom fields (including text, dropdowns, checkboxes, URLs, and more) into the standard Basic Details form.</p><hr><h2>Some Smart Field Suggestions</h2><h3>Generic Fields (applicable to most niche and industries)</h3><p><strong>1) Gender (Radio Buttons):</strong> Capture gender identity for personalization or analytics.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/309f2d600c18f7d135219cd5fa6d2c4b4621302a.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"589c3e65 c6a2 49c5 83a1 9c0cf988ab52\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"56\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/e7bcc881e5e6c8853bf765abac9ef6b8c687c287.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 94.5967px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"24d134aa 3a07 4df9 8584 15b7ce0f0912\" width=\"1154\" height=\"144\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br><strong>2) Date of Birth:&nbsp;</strong>Capture birthdate to calculate age.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/e59d5cda69925e4071ba9204a676b3b00230db56.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56.2467px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"a3d098c9 4b02 4456 8700 f03f572c24e9\" width=\"767\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/b49c29b8baff11ea52bad6cc8858ea9e9c8e0f96.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 73.8593px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"11f7ea00 4e45 4ad4 b481 2c57ec88dd74\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"74\"></p><p><br><strong>3) Phone Number:&nbsp;</strong>Ensure you have a reliable contact point for leads or support.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/fcba3c636699565f3a93efa05e08fbb414cb2d87.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56.2467px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"6a5066f6 0712 4240 97d8 1456dfcb8825\" width=\"1600\" height=\"116\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/3d72f11428ae1ad7bf52fbb0cc8c6b94fd2b0ee8.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 102.267px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"77bf9ab2 a900 4e0d af90 2029acc98fe9\" width=\"1600\" height=\"215\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br><strong>4) Native Languages (Dropdown):&nbsp;</strong>Help members stand out and enable better matches for multilingual services.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/11899e5258edbdf95966f4d29b8d4a0f53daa3d1.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56.2467px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"068f5c98 c27c 4173 a1db 37f607ca978b\" width=\"1600\" height=\"116\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/a0c712562b0dc79d8bd509f67b811e84647f60ef.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 268.45px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"aad90cda cb0b 46b3 b3d9 91f094cf043f\" width=\"1560\" height=\"548\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3>Some Niche Relevant Field Suggestions:</h3><p><strong>1. Real Estate Agents/Brokers</strong></p><p><strong>Brokerage Affiliation (Text Input):</strong><br>Captures the specific brokerage firm the agent works under (e.g., Coldwell Banker, Keller Williams), crucial for highly professional directories.</p><p><strong>Affiliations/Certifications (Choice Field):</strong><br>Lists professional organizations, designations (e.g., REALTOR&reg;, GRI), or specialized certifications held by the agent, indicating expertise and professional commitment.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/db3ea7b5857228a8aceb62e70ddef8ff7a5f60ac.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56.2467px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"1bb4e376 04b3 40d4 9544 1d80fa45a997\" width=\"1600\" height=\"116\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/2e47aa62304634aef6507d4a009e417cf7ebc7a6.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 547.127px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"53000a29 ecbe 4eae 9bd0 10c02ab36381\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"547\"></p><p><br><strong>2. Wedding &amp; Event Planners</strong></p><p><strong>Preferred Event Size Range (Dropdown):</strong><br>Allows planners to specify the typical guest count range they handle best (e.g., Under 50, 50-150, 150-300, 300+).</p><p><strong>Available Service Packages (Checkboxes):</strong><br>Planners can select their primary offering structures (e.g., Full Service Planning, Day-Of Coordination, A La Carte Services).<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/bf543c8f55dbcc8b6c7d9adad43e07a488ef8fd3.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56.2467px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"14fe0b37 1518 44c2 83b8 e93e3c69f0ec\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"56\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/4dc6f22b66b4ab036924b7752190aab3a7aeddda.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 186.532px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"839f5c20 d016 4093 a837 b4518feb1df1\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"187\"></p><p><br><strong>3. Personal Trainers &amp; Fitness Coaches</strong></p><p><strong>Certifications Held (Multi-Select Dropdown):</strong><br>Lists recognized industry certifications (e.g., NASM, ACE, CSCS, CrossFit Level 1) to build trust and allow for specialized filtering.</p><p><strong>Training Specialty (Radio Buttons):</strong><br>Narrows down the focus of their coaching (e.g., Weight Loss, Strength &amp; Conditioning, Rehabilitation/Prehab, Nutritional Guidance, Group Fitness).<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/4d456f5da15c6f73ce04d1cf2207a2fb57cf1d4a.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56.2467px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"608d7443 f5d9 4bce 8674 97f22f892ccc\" width=\"1600\" height=\"116\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/bc69418c0e656ff85b22f92871c3303322735a88.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 204.533px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"f0f7fcfd 7058 467e b488 811c3f7b5de1\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"205\"></p><p><br><strong>4. Legal Professionals (Attorneys/Lawyers)</strong></p><p><strong>State Bar Admission Year (Number Field):</strong><br>A clear indicator of how long the attorney has been licensed to practice law in their jurisdiction.</p><p><strong>Jurisdictions Practiced (Multi-Select Text):</strong><br>Allows listing specific counties or judicial districts where the professional regularly operates or is licensed.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/f80ec41ab2f8d2a4a4ee7f10f98062018756c8ba.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 56.6913px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"2f224f71 8049 4068 bfa1 1ae4a014a567\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"57\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/0ec4e3e6c6bf2db020d2bd7c4967d9c51e4cc287.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 112.493px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"2a2d6e3f e07b 4a8e 8a81 38e066e0d495\" width=\"830\" height=\"123\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Up to 3 Straightforward Fields &rarr; Included in $20</strong><br>Or,<br><strong>Advanced validation, conditional logic, or data relationships &rarr; $20 per field</strong><br>Simple additions are affordable, and complex logic is fairly priced.</p><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests&nbsp;</strong>(if any) are quoted separately after review &mdash;<strong>&nbsp;nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Ready to collect the data that actually matters?</h2><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to add your custom fields on contact detail page.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '1e3f7adf851258011ebf8fe341374c4d', 'solutions/additional-fields-on-contact-detail-page', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Contact Fields', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(598, 101, 'Custom Landing Page Design for Brilliant Directories Websites', '<p><strong>From Clicks to Conversions &mdash; Turn Every Campaign into Measurable Results.</strong></p><p>Your <strong>landing page</strong> isn&rsquo;t just another page &mdash; it&rsquo;s your <strong>digital first impression</strong> for targeted visitors.</p><p>We design and build <strong>custom landing pages</strong> that align perfectly with your <strong>campaigns, offers, or niche goals</strong> &mdash; built to <strong>capture attention, drive action, and perform seamlessly</strong> on Brilliant Directories.</p><hr class=\"cc-divider\"><p>[widget=custom_themes_section_design]</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '22ed9941e1698735d8c13285b437a69f', 'solutions/custom-landing-page-design-for-brilliant-directories-websites', 1, 0, '', 'Order Now', '', 4, 83, 'Branding,UI/UX,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'starts_from', 'service', '', '', 'Delivery Time', '12_weeks', 'Warrenty', ' ', ' ', 'Landing Page Design', 'Landing Page Design', 'fully_custom', ' ', 50.00, 'deposit'),
(599, 101, 'Business Highlights for Member Profiles', '<p><strong>Give your members a powerful way to showcase what makes their business shine with Business Highlights for Brilliant Directories!</strong></p><p>The <strong>Business Highlights for Member Profiles</strong> tool allows members to add visual icon-text badges (like Free Parking, Pet-Friendly, Open 24/7) directly on their Profile Detail Page (Overview tab). These highlights make profiles more attractive, trustworthy, and user-friendly &mdash; helping visitors quickly see what sets a business apart.</p><hr><h2>What are Business Highlights?</h2><p><strong>Business Highlights</strong> are quick-glance icons + text tags that highlight key services or amenities. These visual badges improve engagement and help users instantly recognize what a business offers.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>Example Highlights:</strong></p><ul><li>Free Parking</li><li>Pet-Friendly</li><li>Free Wi-Fi</li><li>Wheelchair Accessible</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><h3>For Admins</h3><p><strong>Manage highlights via the Business Highlights Plugin in the Admin Panel.</strong></p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/4b98f9f0f44270f48809f48ba1c483978d543757.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 347.707px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\" \" width=\"2516\" height=\"1148\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br><strong>Admin adding a new Highlights / Items like Free Parking or Wheelchair Accessible, using the &ldquo;Add Highlight&rdquo; button.</strong></p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/a2df5fe78d3f08b15fc2c41b4b3a0f2b292207ff.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"80cf8d40 e503 4cdd 9d5b b9239099efd3\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"430\"></p><p><br>Edit or delete highlights from a clean table with icon previews.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/4e448da526a1e429f5b9213aa9251dab1cdd4419.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.291px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"84e33a5d bb2e 4b4c bae2 5a6c45ba2341\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"429\"></p><p><br>Control access using Membership Level Toggles &mdash; decide which tiers can use highlights.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/cd41ad2874e14aaf001106d6c0ee8c6ed53987af.gif\" style=\"width: 671px; height: 375.76px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"bd2021b2 a471 4086 bc42 2505006dd4d5\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h3>For Members</h3><p>Access highlights from the Listing Details Form in the dashboard and Select relevant highlights that best represent their business.</p><p><img data-fr-image-pasted=\"true\" src=\"/images/solutions/1834cd628bf71e1a2dcf16ac1ffc7d509f5e923e.gif\" alt=\"e7a42741 0e80 418b 8018 c885d95587b9\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"429\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"><br></p><p>Chosen highlights instantly appear on their public profile (Overview tab).</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/7f1048ebe229ff638d58e6a26a564c582a2855b2.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"92c84cc7 914e 4565 828f af38eaa63835\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>Why Use Business Highlights?</h2><ul><li>Make profiles visually appealing</li><li>Clearly showcase unique features</li><li>Help users make faster, better decisions</li><li>Differentiates premium membership tiers</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit few details</strong><br>Enter your name, email, website URL, and any required details to proceed with the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm your Order</strong><br>Once payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no approval or meeting is needed for this plugin/service.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Communication &amp; Installation Instructions</strong><br>You&rsquo;ll hear from us within 2 business days (usually under 24 hours).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>We&rsquo;ll send:</strong></p><ul><li>Installation steps &mdash; you can do it yourself, and</li><li>Any additional questions only if required (e.g., clarification depending on the nature of plugin/service, or admin access if you requested our help with implementation).</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Installation &ndash; You Choose Who Does It</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You can either:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Install it yourself&nbsp;</strong>using the guide we provide, or</li><li><strong>Ask our team to install it for you</strong> at no extra cost.</li></ul><hr><h2>Let Your Members Shine!</h2><p>Help your members highlight what they do best &mdash; and give your directory a modern, professional edge.<br>Click<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> today and enhance every profile with Business Highlights!</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '6b8ed5ec232c95dd89dbf4b2482ba9fd', 'solutions/business-highlights-for-member-profiles', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Customizations,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 450.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Business Highlights', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(600, 101, 'Complete Business Hours for Brilliant Directories', '<p><strong>It&#39;s a complete Business Hours solution &mdash; not just displaying hours simply.</strong></p><p>Show <strong>real-time open/closed status</strong> on your directory.</p><p>Make it more useful, actionable, and credible with the integrated <strong>Hours of Operation</strong> feature.This tool displays <strong>live business hours</strong> on profiles, in search results, and even enables filters like <strong>Open Now</strong> or <strong>Closed Now</strong>.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">Let&rsquo;s help visitors find the right business at the right time.</blockquote><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><h3>Members Can Add or Update Business Hours</h3><h4>Member Dashboard Experience</h4><p>Members can manage their business hours for each day of the week directly from the <strong>Additional Listing</strong> /<strong>Additional Details</strong> tab in their dashboard.</p><p>The interface is fast, intuitive, and seamlessly integrated with their profile.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/8fbb506059fdb7432478dc417ab0eb4fe4482498.gif\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 420.174px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"6ddd8c13 6a5d 4584 94eb 330db3b8eb55\" width=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"420\"></p><hr><h3>Visitors Can Filter by Open Status</h3><p><strong>Sidebar Filter</strong></p><p>While browsing, visitors can instantly filter businesses based on live operating status:</p><ul><li><strong>Open Now</strong></li><li><strong>Closing Soon</strong></li></ul><p>This toggle makes it effortless to find who&rsquo;s currently available or about to open or close.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/4a31f288fe05bad6bad1ee92b81723833fb200bf.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"5631f1d1 d111 4a3b 9e45 54e577cf3116\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h3>Dynamic Status on Search Results Page</h3><p>In the directory results, each business dynamically updates its label based on real-time hours:</p><table style=\"width:100%;max-width:800px;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;border:1px solid #000;\"><thead style=\"background:#f9f9f9;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\"><strong>Time Range</strong></th><th style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\"><strong>Display</strong></th><th style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\"><strong>Label Color Example</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">Before opening hour (e.g., 9:00 AM)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\"><strong>Opening Soon</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">Orange</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">During business hours (e.g., 10 AM&ndash;6 PM)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\"><strong>Open Now</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">Green</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">Within one hour of closing (e.g., 6 PM&ndash;7 PM)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\"><strong>Closes Soon</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">Yellow</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">After closing (e.g., post 7 PM)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\"><strong>Closed</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:10px;\">RED</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/26384d352aef6da9746de614df562c32aad09196.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 615.716px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"741643a6 08a2 4f49 a8f7 d93773ff481e\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"616\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>List of Status</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Opening Soon</strong> &ndash; x minutes or hours prior to open time (configurable)</li><li><strong>Open Now</strong></li><li><strong>Closes Soon</strong> &ndash; x minutes or hours prior to closing time (configurable)</li><li><strong>Closed</strong></li></ul><p>The <strong>x minutes prior to opening and closing</strong>, and <strong>colors of all four status buttons</strong> are configurable.</p><hr><h3>Business Hours on Individual&rsquo;s Profile Page</h3><p>Each profile shows a <strong>live operational badge</strong> (<strong>Open Now</strong>, <strong>Closed Now</strong>, <strong>Opening Soon</strong>, or <strong>Closing Soon</strong>) along with their <strong>business hours</strong> displayed.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/d7508c7206c6193a9d55540debd478c78aae01f8.gif\" style=\"width: 709px; height: 397.04px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"4a6ee819 2e6f 4ce1 ae5c 3f7fc4b02b8b\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h3>To Summarize &ndash; Quick Recap</h3><p>Want to add business hours to your Brilliant Directories site? We can help you:</p><ul><li>Display hours of operation on profile pages</li><li>Show real-time status badges (Open / Closed / Opens Soon / Closes Soon)</li><li>Let members edit their own business hours</li><li>Add sidebar filters for &ldquo;Open Now / Closed Now&rdquo;</li><li>Configure &ldquo;Soon&rdquo; thresholds per your business logic</li></ul><hr><h2>Why Add Business Hours?</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li><strong>See real-time availability</strong> &mdash; instantly know if a business is <strong>Open</strong>, <strong>Closed</strong>, <strong>Opening Soon</strong>, or <strong>Closing Soon</strong>.</li><li><strong>Smarter search experience</strong> &mdash; filter results to show only listings that are <strong>Open Now</strong>.</li><li><strong>Visual clarity</strong> &mdash; color-coded status badges on every search result card and profile.</li><li><strong>Better planning</strong> &mdash; visitors can schedule visits or appointments with confidence.</li><li><strong>Faster decisions</strong> &mdash; no need to guess who&rsquo;s available; real-time data makes browsing effortless.</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li><strong>Simple control</strong> &mdash; easily set and update weekly business hours from the dashboard.</li><li><strong>Professional appearance</strong> &mdash; display verified hours that build trust and credibility.</li><li><strong>More visibility</strong> &mdash; appear in <strong>&ldquo;Open Now&rdquo;</strong> search filters to attract active visitors ready to make a buying decision.</li><li><strong>Increased meaningful inquiries</strong> &mdash; avoid repeated questions like &ldquo;Are you currently open?&rdquo; and focus on real business inquiries.</li></ul><h3>For Directory Owners</h3><ul><li><strong>Boosts repeat traffic</strong> &mdash; visitors return more often when listings show live, accurate hours.</li><li><strong>Reduced user friction</strong> &mdash; eliminate confusion caused by outdated business timings.</li><li><strong>Higher engagement &amp; trust</strong> &mdash; accurate &ldquo;Open Now&rdquo; data enhances platform credibility.</li><li><strong>Actionable insights</strong> &mdash; track open/active listings to improve reporting and monetization.</li><li><strong>Feature parity with Google Maps</strong> &mdash; if we lack this important feature, users will choose Google Maps over your directory.</li></ul><hr><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $450</strong> &mdash; covers the full business-hours system: member dashboard hours input, real-time open/closed status calculation, dynamic badges on profiles and search results, and basic &ldquo;Open Now / Closing Soon&rdquo; filter integration.</p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Multi-timezone support (U.S. zones or international)</li><li>Complex <strong>&ldquo;Next-Day&rdquo;</strong> or midnight-hour handling</li><li>Custom status logic or custom badge styles/animations</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests&nbsp;</strong>(if any) are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp / Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong><br>Implementation plan<br>Estimated delivery timeline<br>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</p><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h3>Activate Business Hours &mdash; Bring Your Directory to Life</h3><p>Turn static listings into live, time-aware profiles. Help visitors instantly see who&rsquo;s open, closing soon, or available right now &mdash; building trust and boosting engagement.</p><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to make your directory more dynamic and useful than ever.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '59ea7eeea82666992ffc041e4a29e6a3', 'solutions/complete-business-hours-for-brilliant-directories', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX,Customizations,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 450.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Business Hours', 'Business Hours', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' ');
INSERT INTO `users_portfolio_groups` (`group_id`, `user_id`, `group_name`, `group_desc`, `group_location`, `group_date`, `date_updated`, `reference_url`, `group_order`, `group_token`, `group_filename`, `group_status`, `structure_id`, `facebook_id`, `additional_fields`, `group_type`, `data_type`, `data_id`, `group_category`, `revision_timestamp`, `lat`, `lon`, `post_tags`, `upload_image_slide`, `post_review`, `property_status`, `property_type`, `reference_url_idea`, `property_price`, `annual_price`, `property_beds`, `property_baths`, `property_sqr_foot`, `sticky_post`, `post_location`, `sticky_post_expiration_date`, `country_sn`, `state_sn`, `revision_count`, `post_excerpt`, `price_unit`, `product_type`, `price_duration`, `widget_name`, `delivery_time_title`, `delivery_time_description`, `warranty_time_title`, `description_time_description`, `demo_video`, `short_title`, `short_title_for_results`, `implementation_type`, `tool_subscription_type`, `commitment_price`, `starts_from_type`) VALUES
(601, 101, 'Custom Member Dashboard Checklist', '<p><strong>Make it easy (and obvious) for members to complete their profiles&mdash;without tech confusion.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Custom Member Dashboard Checklist&nbsp; feature</strong> helps ensure members complete their setup with ease by providing a clear, step-by-step checklist inside their dashboard. This tool improves onboarding, boosts engagement, and guarantees members don&rsquo;t miss any important actions.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Note:</strong> This checklist is tailored to your specific member fields, so users only see what&rsquo;s relevant&mdash;and nothing more.</blockquote><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Members sign up and land on their dashboard.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/checklist-from-signup-to-dashboard-landing-1.webp\" alt=\"Checklist from signup to dashboard landing\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  border-radius: 0.5rem;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-processed=\"true\" width=\"767\" height=\"431\"></p><p><br><strong>Step 2:</strong> A visible checklist guides them through each setup step.</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Completed sections show a green tick, indicating progress.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>Step 4: How the Checklist Displays &amp; Updates</strong></p><ul><li>The first <strong>5&ndash;7 most important steps</strong> are shown at the top by default.</li><li>The remaining steps stay neatly hidden under a <strong>&ldquo;View More&rdquo;</strong> option to avoid overwhelm.</li><li>As members complete the initial steps, those move to the &ldquo;Completed&rdquo; section, and the next pending steps automatically appear in the visible list.</li></ul><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/video-after-dashboard-landing-1-5x-speed-ezgif.com-gif-to-webp-converter.webp\" alt=\"Video after dashboard landing\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 0.5rem;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-processed=\"true\" width=\"767\" height=\"431\"></p><hr><h2 id=\"isPasted\">Why This Checklist Matters</h2><p>A confusing or incomplete signup experience is one of the fastest ways to lose new members. The <strong>Member Dashboard Checklist</strong> turns your BD signup and profile flow into a guided, intuitive experience&mdash;just like the big brands do.</p><hr><h2>What It Solves for Everyone</h2><h3>Visitors (End Users)</h3><ul><li>Discover detailed business profiles</li><li>Trust listings with photos, services, and contact info</li><li>Navigate better with organized, relevant data</li><li>Build confidence through more credible, complete profiles</li><li>Experience a stronger first impression of your platform</li></ul><h3>Members (Service Providers)</h3><ul><li>Follow a clear, step-by-step guide to complete their profile</li><li>Stay motivated with visual progress indicators</li><li>Increase chances of being featured or ranking well</li><li>Reduce confusion and support requests</li><li>Feel supported and professional during onboarding</li></ul><h3>Site Owners</h3><ul><li>Enhance UX and first-time experience across the board</li><li>Collect more complete business data = better SEO + results</li><li>Customize the checklist to match your site&rsquo;s fields and logic</li><li>Reduce support load from onboarding confusion</li><li>Segment members better and enable smarter upsells</li><li>Profile completed = They feel it&rsquo;s &ldquo;their&rdquo; platform = They stay longer.</li></ul><hr><h3>🚀 Next Steps</h3><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit few details</strong><br>Enter your name, email, website URL, and any required details to proceed with the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm your Order</strong><br>Once payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no approval or meeting is needed for this plugin/service.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Communication &amp; Installation Instructions</strong><br>You&rsquo;ll hear from us within 2 business days (usually under 24hours).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>We&rsquo;ll send:</strong></p><ul><li>Installation steps &mdash; you can do it yourself, and</li><li>Any additional questions only if required (e.g., clarification depending on the nature of plugin/service, or admin access if you requested our help with implementation).</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Installation &ndash; You Choose Who Does It</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>You can either:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Install it yourself</strong> using the guide we provide, or</li><li><strong>Ask our team to install it for you</strong> at no extra cost.</li></ul><hr><h2>Ready to Guide Your Members to Complete Profiles?</h2><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to add this Dashboard Checklist to your site today and streamline onboarding for everyone.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '89da3b5ed0f312cd2cc00c7933d84f80', 'solutions/custom-member-dashboard-checklist', 1, 0, '', 'Order Now', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', '/uploads/curriculum-vitae/upload_image_slide/101-1748344942-file.jpg', '', '', '', '', 450.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'service', '', '', 'Delivery', '12_weeks', 'Warranty ', ' ', ' ', 'Dashboard Checklist', 'Member Dashboard Checklist', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, 'deposit'),
(602, 101, 'Custom Member Profile Detail Page Design for Brilliant Directories', '<p><strong>From Basic to Brilliant &mdash; Transform Every Member Profile into a Showcase That Converts.</strong></p><p>Your <strong>member profile page</strong> is where visitors decide whether to <strong>connect, contact, or move on.</strong></p><p>We design and build <strong>custom profile layouts</strong> that highlight each member&rsquo;s strengths, improve readability, and add <strong>modern visual appeal</strong> &mdash; built to <strong>engage visitors, boost credibility, and perform flawlessly</strong> on Brilliant Directories.</p><hr class=\"cc-divider\"><p>[widget=custom_themes_section_design]</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, 'c84b4358d66333b0e60165964660db4f', 'solutions/custom-member-profile-detail-page-design-for-brilliant-directories', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 450.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'starts_from', 'service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Profile Design', ' ', 'fully_custom', ' ', 50.00, 'deposit'),
(603, 101, 'Custom Signup or Checkout Page', '<p><strong>From Friction to Flow &mdash; Simplify Signups and Boost Member Registrations.</strong></p><p>Your <strong>signup page</strong> is where <strong>interest turns into action</strong> &mdash; and every extra click or confusion can cost a new member.</p><p>We design and build <strong>custom signup pages</strong> that make joining effortless, visually clear, and <strong>conversion-driven</strong> &mdash; built to <strong>guide users smoothly through the process</strong> and perform seamlessly on Brilliant Directories.</p><hr class=\"cc-divider\"><p>[widget=custom_themes_section_design]</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, 'b43e25381cbf7448b5f820f612a3c734', 'solutions/custom-signup-or-checkout-page', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Customizations', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 99.00, 399.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Signup Page', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(604, 101, 'How to Edit Existing Tabs on Member Profile Pages', '<p><strong>Make your member profile pages work smarter &mdash; not messier.</strong></p><p>Instead of stuffing your directory with more and more tabs, this service improves the ones you already have. We refine naming, structure, and order, so your existing tabs feel intentional, on-brand, and relevant to your niche.</p><hr><h2>See what BD default is and what we will do</h2><h3>Some Examples and Use Cases</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">A simple change like switching <strong>&ldquo;Overview&rdquo;</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/e9b74025e577c8346e2280f727eb11a5c1dd8887.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 283.79px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"64d1171f 3ee8 46e4 8e5f 4d485869fcd6\" width=\"1070\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br><strong>to&nbsp;</strong><strong>&ldquo;About Us&rdquo;</strong><strong>.</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/62973dd930e7abc81036d6eea296315da6011168.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 294.017px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"d7aa3c1d beb2 4df0 8d36 53a3103cb8d9\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"294\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">Or, changing the tab name for the Events post type in Real Estate Directories from&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;Events&rdquo;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/e4ebbe4164a7755d25ceb225cd9a530f62550bce.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 232.657px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"49ccc790 4dec 4ba0 83a2 aa6162ec4596\" width=\"1075\" height=\"328\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong><br></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">to&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;Open House&rdquo;</strong> as it&#39;s suitable for the Real Estate Industry.<br><img src=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/images/cb1ab42d2a82b1f63e34022bd1c30f7700cc7a27.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 232.657px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"0de2ba85 68a6 4166 a53f da6ac3afd7e2\" width=\"1066\" height=\"326\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Or, reordering tabs for a Real Estate Directory like: About Agency, Properties, Open House.</strong></p><p>These micro-tweaks help members present themselves better, help visitors find information faster, and help you maintain cleaner, more consistent profile pages across your directory.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>The result: stronger engagement, smoother navigation, and profiles that actually feel built for your niche.</strong></blockquote><hr><h2>Edit Existing Tabs on Member Profile Pages Yourself (DIY)</h2><p>If you like to Do It Yourself (DIY), which just means doing the work yourself, Brilliant Directories has some helpful instructions for you:</p><hr><h3>Edit Existing Tabs on Member Profile Pages</h3><p>Easily control how member profiles appear on your site.</p><p><strong>Change the Name of Tabs (Title &amp; URL)</strong><br>Customize the name, title, and URL of the tabs that display different types of posts on a member&#39;s profile.</p><p><a href=\"https://bootstrap.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000028489-how-to-change-the-name-tab-title-url-of-a-post-type\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&nbsp;How to Change the Name (Tab Title/URL) of a Post Type <i class=\"fa fa-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></p><p><strong>Change the Order of Tabs</strong><br>Adjust the display order of tabs for members based on their specific membership group.</p><p><a href=\"https://bootstrap.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000049272-finance-membership-plans-profile-page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&nbsp;Finance - Membership Plans - Profile Page <i class=\"fa fa-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></p><hr><h2>Don&#39;t Have Time or Need Expert Help? Let Us Do It!</h2><p>Doing it yourself is great, but we can save you time and headache. We&#39;ll look at your website, suggest the best way to set up your tabs, and make sure everything is optimized for you right away.</p><p>You&#39;ll get the perfect result without having to learn all the steps first, and you&#39;ll still have full control if you ever want to change things later!</p><div style=\"background:#f9f9f9;border-left:4px solid #E74D56;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0;\"><p style=\"font-size:16px!important;\"><strong>Our Quick Tab Edit Service Starts at Just $20</strong></p><p>For most websites, our $20 service will get the job done!</p><p><strong>This includes:</strong></p><p><strong>Option A:&nbsp;</strong>Changing tab names for up to&nbsp;<strong>3 different post types</strong> (like &quot;Classifieds&quot; or &quot;Coupons&quot;).<br>Or,<br><strong>Option B:</strong> Changing the order of tabs for up to <strong>3 different membership plans.</strong></p><p>This covers about 90% of what most directories need!</p></div><p>If you need changes for more post types or more membership plans, we can send you a separate quote.</p><p><strong>Pay $20 and let&#39;s get started on your initial edit!</strong></p><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>to get started.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '9078b61fe71670fa2310ddeae3588dfc', 'solutions/how-to-edit-existing-tabs-on-member-profile-pages', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'UI/UX', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Profile Tabs', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, 'deposit'),
(605, 101, 'Introduction Video for Member Profiles', '<p><strong>Give member profiles a personal touch with video</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">Make every profile more engaging&mdash;with just one click.</blockquote><p>The <strong>Introduction Video for Member Profiles</strong> service lets your members easily upload a YouTube or Vimeo video directly from their dashboard, adding a professional intro video to their profile. It&rsquo;s an ideal way for consultants, service providers, creatives, or any business to build trust quickly and showcase their personality with ease.</p><hr><h2>What This Service Does</h2><p>This service lets your members add a YouTube or Vimeo introduction video directly to their profile, instantly making their listing more personal and engaging. It helps visitors connect faster, builds trust, and gives every profile a professional edge with zero effort.</p><h3>How It Works for Members</h3><p>A new button&mdash;&ldquo;Introduction Video&rdquo;&mdash;is added to the member dashboard. When clicked:</p><ul><li>A form appears with a dropdown to select video type: YouTube or Vimeo</li><li>Based on the selection, an input field appears for the URL or embed code</li><li>Upon submission, the video is rendered instantly via an iframe in the dashboard</li><li>The video is also displayed on the live profile page (optional)</li></ul><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/0be907578253640d6ef9c0fbbc312390ce4dcfee.gif\" alt=\"Video upload demo\" width=\"565\" height=\"344\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></p><h3>Where the Video Appears</h3><ul><li>In the member dashboard (preview window)</li><li>On the live profile page (configured to display where you want)</li><li>Will be styled to appear in headers, bio sections, or video blocks</li></ul><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/bbf3d41f8af58b88d625e9f7f6e4bbcf6cdfca01.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"d37fe42a c302 4c43 97f0 b6e5df114d4f\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>Why Add Introduction Videos?</h2><h4>For Visitors</h4><ul><li>Instantly get to know the member before contacting them</li><li>Builds trust with visual and voice presence</li><li>Videos load responsively and look great on mobile</li></ul><h4>For Members</h4><ul><li>Share a YouTube or Vimeo video with just a link</li><li>Showcase expertise and build credibility</li><li>An easy form to update or change their video anytime</li></ul><h4>For Site Owners</h4><ul><li>Adds engaging content to member profiles</li><li>Upsell for premium membership tiers</li><li>Fully integrates with existing profile layouts</li></ul><hr><h2>Pricing Clarity</h2><p><strong>Base Service: $50</strong> &mdash; covers adding the Introduction Video feature to member profiles, including the dashboard button, YouTube/Vimeo input form, live profile video display, iframe rendering, and responsive styling.</p><h3>When Additional Charges Apply:</h3><ul><li>Custom styling beyond standard layout</li><li>Integrating analytics or video engagement tracking</li><li>Creating separate mobile/desktop display behaviour</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests&nbsp;</strong>(if any) are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp / Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong><br>Implementation plan<br>Estimated delivery timeline<br>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</p><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Ready to Enable Introduction Videos?</h2><p>Click &ldquo;<strong>Order Now</strong>&rdquo; to let members showcase their personality and expertise through video.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '3acdcd709e07e4ac642daab2305b889e', 'solutions/introduction-video-for-member-profiles', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Branding,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 50.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Intro Video', ' ', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(606, 101, 'Photo Gallery for Members', '<p><strong>Visually Showcase Member Work with Ease</strong></p><p>Turn your members&rsquo; profiles into stunning visual showcases.&nbsp;<br>The <strong>Photo Gallery Upload Service</strong> empowers members to upload multiple images directly from their dashboards, automatically generating a clean, responsive gallery inside their profile&rsquo;s Overview tab.</p><p>Perfect for professionals, artists, and service providers &mdash; anyone who wants to display their work, portfolio, or space beautifully and effortlessly.</p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Let your members shine through visuals that speak louder than words.</strong></blockquote><hr><h2>What This Service Does</h2><p>This plugin lets members upload and manage multiple photos that appear instantly on their public profiles &mdash; fully optimized, mobile-friendly, and styled to match your site design.</p><hr><h2>See It in Action</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> <strong>Uploading Multiple Photos from Dashboard</strong><br>Members can upload multiple images and delete unwanted ones. Each image is instantly previewed and saved automatically.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/ced37099117f169ac9c4499ed2ae39bbfc3820f9.gif\" style=\"width: 759px; height: 425.04px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"6284688c 94c7 45fa 8083 bcef6f534284\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br><strong>Step 2:</strong> <strong>Displays on Member Profile Detail Page</strong><br>The gallery appears on their public profile &mdash; under the Overview tab &mdash; using your chosen layout or preferred position.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/ff29356952a0c628986c84bd818ab31bf5a86218.png\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 373.434px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"147e0b9c 20a3 40d2 a12d c8cd66afafd7\" width=\"767\" loading=\"lazy\" data-processed=\"true\" height=\"373\"></p><hr><h2>Why Add a Photo Gallery?</h2><h3>For Visitors</h3><ul><li>Instantly understand what a member offers through visuals</li><li>Browse high-quality images without leaving the profile</li><li>Enjoy a seamless, mobile-friendly, swipe-ready viewing experience</li></ul><h3>For Members</h3><ul><li>Upload multiple photos &mdash; no tech skills needed</li><li>Visually showcase their services, events, or past projects</li><li>Easily manage and update images anytime from their dashboard</li></ul><h3>For Site Owners</h3><ul><li>Add eye-catching, premium content to every listing</li><li>Use as an upgrade feature for higher membership tiers</li><li>Enjoy fully branded galleries that enhance the overall look of your directory</li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, website URL, and any basic info required to start your order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm Your Order</strong><br>Once the payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no meeting or approval is needed to begin.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Our Message for Final Inputs</strong><br>Within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually &lt;24 hours), we&rsquo;ll reach out for anything we need &mdash; such as images, icons, branding elements, text, or your design/style preferences.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Quick Implementation After Your Approval</strong><br>We&rsquo;ll share the proposed plan, layout, or design options.<br>Once you confirm, <strong>we implement it at the earliest</strong> and handle everything end-to-end.</p><hr><h2>Show, Don&rsquo;t Just Tell &mdash; Let Every Profile Speak Visually</h2><p>Turn every member listing into a mini portfolio that attracts, convinces, and converts.</p><p>Click<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to enable Photo Gallery uploads and bring visual storytelling to your Brilliant Directories site.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '95d01049d34c79c74b2ee890e0c7df66', 'solutions/photo-gallery-for-members', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Branding,Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 195.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Photo Gallery', ' ', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' '),
(607, 101, 'FAQ Management Plugin', '<p><strong>Enhance user experience and boost SEO.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\">Add Smart, Page-Specific FAQs Anywhere on Your Brilliant Directories Site</blockquote><p>The <strong>FAQ Management Plugin</strong> lets you create and manage FAQs for different <strong>page or post types</strong> of your <strong>Brilliant Directories website</strong> &mdash; all from one central admin interface. You can add FAQs to your homepage, join page, and even in the results and detail pages of any post types &mdash; without writing code or duplicating content.</p><hr><h2>Display Dynamic FAQs &mdash; Fully Controlled by Admin</h2><h3>What This Plugin Does</h3><p>This plugin lets you create and display page-specific FAQs anywhere across your Brilliant Directories website. Instead of maintaining one global FAQ list, you can create individual FAQs and choose exactly where each one should appear &mdash; giving you clean, contextual answers for every page or post type.</p><p>All FAQs are managed from a single dashboard where you can easily add, edit, delete, and reorder without touching any widgets or theme code. The FAQs instantly show on the selected locations in a modern, mobile-friendly accordion.</p><p>In simple words:<br>Choose display location &rarr; Create FAQ &rarr; Done<br>No confusion, no clutter, no developer dependency.</p><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><strong>Step 1: Choose Where FAQs Appear</strong><br>When adding or editing an FAQ, select where it should show:</p><ul><li><strong>Static Pages</strong> &ndash; Home, Join, Contact, About, Privacy Policy, or any custom page.</li><li><strong>Post Type Pages</strong> &ndash; Events, Jobs, Properties, Coupons, Classifieds, etc.</li><li>Each post type supports <strong>Search Results</strong> and <strong>Detail Pages</strong>, letting you display targeted FAQs for each context.</li></ul><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/faqlanding-page.gif\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"bedad1ff 2fa5 49e1 bf94 1fa436119b96\" width=\"1434\" height=\"1432\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><br><strong>Step 2: Manage Everything from One Dashboard</strong><br>Access the<strong>&nbsp;FAQ Management Panel</strong> to add, edit, delete, or reorder FAQs for page or post type you selected.<br>All updates apply instantly across your site &mdash; no coding, widgets, or layout edits.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/manage_FAQ.gif\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"bedad1ff 2fa5 49e1 bf94 1fa436119b96\" width=\"1434\" height=\"1432\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px!important;\"><br><strong>Step 3: Smart Front-End Display</strong><br>The plugin automatically detects the page type and displays the matching FAQs &mdash;</p><ul><li>Join Page &rarr; Join FAQs</li><li>Member Profile &rarr; Member FAQs</li><li>Events &rarr; Event FAQs</li></ul><p>Displayed in a clean, mobile-friendly accordion with built-in FAQ Schema for SEO and AI visibility.</p><p><img src=\"/images/solutions/FAQs-display.gif?tr=w-390,f-webp,q-75\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"bedad1ff 2fa5 49e1 bf94 1fa436119b96\" width=\"1434\" height=\"1432\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>Why Add Dynamic FAQs to Your BD Site</h2><h3>For Visitors (People Browsing Your Directory)</h3><ul><li><strong>Answers where they matter most</strong> &mdash; join, search, profile, post</li><li><strong>No confusion, no guesswork&nbsp;</strong>&mdash; the site answers questions before users even ask.</li><li><strong>Faster decisions</strong> &mdash; clear FAQs reduce hesitation during signup, booking, or contact.</li><li><strong>Feels like a smarter website</strong> &mdash; users don&rsquo;t need to leave the page or contact support.</li></ul><h3>For Members (Who Pay to Get Listed or Post Content)</h3><ul><li><strong>More trust on their profiles or posts</strong> &mdash; FAQs appear on member detail and post detail pages, adding credibility.</li><li><strong>Better visibility in search &amp; AI answers</strong> &mdash; when FAQs also show on search result pages, Google and LLMs (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini) can understand and highlight those pages more easily.</li><li><strong>Fewer &quot;How do I&hellip;?&quot; messages</strong> &mdash; clarity on rules, pricing, renewals, approvals, and listing guidelines.</li><li><strong>Makes them feel supported and guided</strong> &mdash; improves member satisfaction and retention.</li></ul><h3>For Directory Owners (Admin + Business Perspective)</h3><ul><li><strong>Higher conversions&nbsp;</strong>&mdash; FAQs on Join/Checkout pages answer objections and increase signups.</li><li><strong>Less support work</strong> &mdash; reduces repeated WhatsApp, email, and call queries.</li><li><strong>LLM-ready content</strong> &mdash; structured FAQs help AI tools understand your business better.</li><li><strong>One admin panel for everything</strong> &mdash; add/edit FAQs once, assign anywhere.</li><li><strong>Page-specific FAQs</strong> &mdash; show targeted FAQs on specific pages.</li><li><strong>Scales with your site</strong> &mdash; 5 FAQs or 500 &mdash; still clean, organized, and manageable.</li><li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Makes your directory feel premium and well-designed.</strong></li></ul><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo; &amp; Submit few details</strong><br>Enter your name, email, website URL, and any required access details to proceed with the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Make the Payment to Confirm your Order</strong><br>Once payment is completed, your order is officially confirmed &mdash; no approval or meeting is needed for this plugin/service.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Expect Communication &amp; Installation Instructions</strong><br>You&rsquo;ll hear from us within <strong>2 business days</strong> (usually under 24hours).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>We&rsquo;ll send:</strong></p><ul><li>Installation steps &mdash; you can do it yourself, and</li><li>Any additional questions only if required (e.g., clarification depending on the nature of plugin/service, or admin access if you requested our help with implementation).</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Installation &ndash; You Choose Who Does It</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You can either:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Install it yourself</strong> using the guide we provide, or</li><li><strong>Ask our team to install it for you&nbsp;</strong>at no extra cost.</li></ul><p><strong>Step 5: Ongoing Support &amp; Continuous Updates</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>As long as your subscription is active:</strong></p><ul><li>We update the plugin to remain compatible with Brilliant Directories updates</li><li>We collect feedback from all users, prioritize improvements, and keep enhancing the plugin</li><li>Our support team is always available if you need help or face any issues</li></ul><hr><h2>Ready to Add Smart FAQs Across Your Site?</h2><p>The FAQ Management Plugin gives you full control &mdash; add, edit, and organize FAQs anywhere on your Brilliant Directories site with ease.<br>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to get the plugin installed and start managing FAQs directly from your admin dashboard &mdash; no coding, no dependency, fully under your control.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, 'bb45db1b1ceab147593df375e0c89cf5', 'solutions/faq-management-plugin', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, ' ', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 20.00, 149.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'subscription', 'tool', '', '', ' ', '3_days', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'FAQ Management', 'FAQ Management', 'readytoimplement', 'monthly,annually', 0.00, ' '),
(608, 101, 'Constant Contact Integration for Member Signup', '<p><strong>Automatically Add New Members to Your Constant Contact List</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px;\">Turn every new signup into a subscriber &mdash; and automate your email marketing from day one.</blockquote><p>The Constant Contact Integration for Member Signup tool connects your Brilliant Directories signup process directly to your Constant Contact list. Every time a user becomes a member on your site, their details are instantly added to your chosen list &mdash; helping you grow your audience automatically, trigger welcome emails, and keep members engaged without any manual work.</p><hr><h2>Why This Matters</h2><p>If you collect members on your directory and manage your marketing inside Constant Contact, manually adding each new signup becomes messy, slow, and error-prone.</p><p>This integration removes all friction.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>New members are added to your list instantly, giving you:</strong></p><ul><li>Stronger onboarding</li><li>Automated welcome emails</li><li>Better engagement</li><li>Cleaner, more consistent data</li></ul><p>No exporting . No manual uploading . No headaches . No missed subscribers.</p><hr><h2>What It Does</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">Whenever a user becomes a member on your BD site &mdash; free or paid &mdash; this integration:</p><ul><li>Captures their signup details</li><li>Sends them to Constant Contact automatically</li><li>Keeps your subscriber list updated in real time</li></ul><p>Your list grows with every new member &mdash; hands-free.</p><hr><h2>What&rsquo;s Included</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>Data pushed from BD Signup &rarr; Constant Contact</strong></p><ul><li>First Name</li><li>Last Name</li><li>Email Address</li><li>Membership Plan</li><li>Signup Date/Time</li><li>Phone Number (if collected)</li><li>Company/Organization (if collected)</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Works</h2><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> You provide your Constant Contact API Key + Access Token<br><strong>Step 2:</strong> We connect your BD signup form to your Constant Contact list<br><strong>Step 3:</strong> New members sign up as normal<br><strong>Step 4:</strong> Their details instantly pushed to Constant Contact</p><p>Everything runs automatically &mdash; no extra steps for you or your team.</p><hr><h2>See It Action</h2><p>Members fill the signup form<br><img src=\"/images/solutions/c4cb4c0f7082c239adc4d09407d7d27b54239f66.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"d24c8974 0563 4ae8 99a4 679178082f24\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>Member details instantly pushed to Constant Contact<br><img src=\"/images/solutions/4c1ddcc54aa70435d110995c852a69536e7dc9fd.gif\" style=\"width: 767px; height: 429.52px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"331014ac 1dfb 4dfc 82c9 f4233922c4d4\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><hr><h2>How It Helps</h2><ul><li>Automatically grow your Constant Contact list</li><li>Eliminate manual list updates forever</li><li>Improve retention through automated onboarding emails</li><li>Trigger email flows, offers, or drip campaigns</li><li>Keep your email marketing synced with BD signups</li><li>Boost engagement without extra work</li></ul><hr><div class=\"cc-price-clarity\"><h3>Price Clarity</h3><p><strong>Base Service: $50</strong> &mdash; covers connecting your Brilliant Directories signup flow to your Constant Contact list, pushing new members instantly with their core details (name, email, plan, signup time, phone/company if collected).</p><p>If your setup requires tagging, segmentation, or additional data mapping, you&rsquo;ll receive a quote for the price difference, and work begins only after your approval.</p><p><strong>Depending on your needs, we might suggest a different CRM solution that&rsquo;s a better fit.<br></strong></p><h4>When Additional Charges Apply:</h4><ul><li>Applying Constant Contact tags or interests</li><li>Sending different member types to different lists</li><li>Mapping extra fields or custom form data</li></ul></div><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p>We&rsquo;ve made the process simple, structured, and respectful of your time.</p><p><strong>Step 1: Order &amp; Payment</strong><br>Click &ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;, enter your details (name, email, website URL), and complete the payment.<br><strong>Your order is officially confirmed once payment is received.</strong></p><blockquote style=\"font-size:14px!important;\"><strong>Extras or custom requests (if any)&nbsp;</strong>are quoted separately after review &mdash; <strong>nothing additional is charged without your approval.</strong></blockquote><p><strong>Step 2: Requirement Confirmation (Email / WhatsApp/Zoom)</strong><br>Our team will get in touch to confirm requirements.<br>If any clarification is needed, we&rsquo;ll request a quick call to finalize details or discuss possible add-ons.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Implementation Begins</strong><br>Development starts based on the approved requirements.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>You&rsquo;ll receive:</strong></p><ul><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Estimated delivery timeline</li><li>Additional invoice (only if extra features are requested)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4: Review, Delivery &amp; Support</strong><br>You review the work on your website.<br>Minor refinements (within scope) are included.<br>Once approved, the project is closed and support is provided as per the warranty terms in your invoice.</p><hr><h2>Want every new member pushed automatically to Constant Contact?</h2><p>Click <strong>&ldquo;Order Now&rdquo;</strong> to activate Constant Contact Integration for Member Signups.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '9137b15b553419114c6e732d753c0b36', 'solutions/constant-contact-integration-for-member-signup', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Integrations,CRM', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 50.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '1_week', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Constant Contact Integration', 'quick', ' ', 0.00, ' ');
INSERT INTO `users_portfolio_groups` (`group_id`, `user_id`, `group_name`, `group_desc`, `group_location`, `group_date`, `date_updated`, `reference_url`, `group_order`, `group_token`, `group_filename`, `group_status`, `structure_id`, `facebook_id`, `additional_fields`, `group_type`, `data_type`, `data_id`, `group_category`, `revision_timestamp`, `lat`, `lon`, `post_tags`, `upload_image_slide`, `post_review`, `property_status`, `property_type`, `reference_url_idea`, `property_price`, `annual_price`, `property_beds`, `property_baths`, `property_sqr_foot`, `sticky_post`, `post_location`, `sticky_post_expiration_date`, `country_sn`, `state_sn`, `revision_count`, `post_excerpt`, `price_unit`, `product_type`, `price_duration`, `widget_name`, `delivery_time_title`, `delivery_time_description`, `warranty_time_title`, `description_time_description`, `demo_video`, `short_title`, `short_title_for_results`, `implementation_type`, `tool_subscription_type`, `commitment_price`, `starts_from_type`) VALUES
(609, 101, 'Job Schema for Job Detail Page', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><em>Turn each job detail page into a fully structured, AI-ready opportunity &mdash; not just a basic listing.</em></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">Your <strong>Job Detail page&nbsp;</strong>is where one specific role comes to life &mdash; title, description, employer, location, pay, and more. This is also the page search engines and AI systems rely on when deciding:</p><ul><li>what the role actually is,</li><li>who is hiring,</li><li>where the job is based (or if it&rsquo;s remote), and</li><li>whether it matches a user&rsquo;s intent.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">Brilliant Directories already outputs a <strong>solid default&nbsp;</strong><strong>JobPosting schema</strong> for each job detail page. That&rsquo;s a big advantage compared to most platforms.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">However, BD&rsquo;s default schema must remain <strong>general and template-driven</strong>. It can&rsquo;t know your hiring model, your monetization strategy, which fields truly matter on your site, or how you want jobs to be interpreted by modern AI.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">This service builds on BD&rsquo;s foundation and provides<strong>&nbsp;a clean, refined, and enriched Job Detail schema that reflects:</strong></p><ul><li>your actual job fields,</li><li>your directory&rsquo;s business model, and</li><li>current best practices for SEO + AI/LLM understanding.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong>The result?</strong></p><p>Google and LLMs can understand a job posting on your site as a<strong>&nbsp;complete, structured</strong><strong>&nbsp;opportunity&nbsp;</strong>&mdash; not just another block of text.</p><hr><h2>What This Implemented Schema Does</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">Instead of leaving things to the generic template, we make sure each job detail page exposes<strong>&nbsp;the right fields, in the right format, with the right meaning.</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><strong>Our implementation:</strong></p><ul><li>Uses JobPosting schema aligned with <strong>Google&rsquo;s latest recommendations</strong></li><li>Keeps your existing BD schema logic but <strong>c</strong><strong>leans, extends, and optimizes&nbsp;</strong>it for your use case</li><li>Confirms and maps essential fields such as:<ul><li>Job Title</li><li>Short, structured Description</li><li>Hiring Organization (name, profile URL, logo where available)</li><li>Employment Type (full-time, part-time, contract, etc.)</li><li>Job Location (onsite, hybrid, remote; city/region/country)</li><li>Date Posted</li><li>Valid Through / Expiry (when available)</li><li>Canonical Job URL</li><li>Base Salary (where provided)</li></ul></li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">When your directory collects richer job data, we can also map fields like:</p><ul><li>Skills / technologies / key competencies</li><li>Experience level</li><li>Education requirements</li><li>Benefits &amp; perks</li><li>Remote-only or multi-region targeting</li><li>Application URL vs profile URL</li></ul><p>We include these<strong>&nbsp;whenever the data exists&nbsp;</strong>on your site &mdash; no extra work for you.</p><blockquote><strong>Tiny comparison (what BD does vs what we do):</strong> BD&rsquo;s default schema is already good: it describes the job, employer, salary, and location. We step in to <strong>review, refine, and extend</strong> that output so the schema matches your real content, avoids bloat, and is easier for search engines + AI systems to trust.</blockquote><hr><h2>How It Works (Behind the Scenes)</h2><ol><li>We review how jobs are stored and displayed on your BD site.</li><li>We map your job fields (including custom fields where relevant) into a refined JobPosting schema template.</li><li>We implement clean JSON-LD on the Job Detail page, aligned to your structure and business rules.</li><li>We validate the output and ensure it passes Google&rsquo;s structured data tests.</li></ol><p>Any new or updated job automatically inherits the improved schema &mdash; no extra steps for your team or members.</p><hr><h2><strong>Live Example (JSON-LD Preview)</strong></h2><p>Below is a simplified example of the Product Detail schema we implement. On your live site, values are generated dynamically from your BD data.</p><table cellpadding=\"14\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); background: rgb(242, 242, 242); width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-family:Courier,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;\">&nbsp;&lt;<span style=\"color:#c18401;background:transparent !important;\">script type</span>=&quot;application/ld+json&quot;&gt;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#50a14f;background:transparent !important;\">{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@context&quot;: &quot;https://schema.org/&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;JobPosting&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@id&quot;: &quot;https://yourdirectory.com/jobs/senior-full-stack-developer#entity&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;mainEntityOfPage&quot;:{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;WebPage&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@id&quot;: &quot;https://yourdirectory.com/jobs/senior-full-stack-developer&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://yourdirectory.com/jobs/senior-full-stack-developer&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Senior Full Stack Developer&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;},&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Senior Full Stack Developer&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;description&quot;: &quot;We are looking for a Senior Full Stack Developer to build and scale high-performance web applications using PHP, JavaScript, and modern frameworks.&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;datePosted&quot;: &quot;2025-01-10T10:00:00+05:30&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;validThrough&quot;: &quot;2025-02-10T23:59:59+05:30&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;employmentType&quot;: &quot;FULL_TIME&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;hiringOrganization&quot;:{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Organization&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Meta Digital Labs&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://yourdirectory.com/companies/meta-digital-labs&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;logo&quot;: &quot;https://yourdirectory.com/uploads/company-logos/meta-digital-labs.png&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; },&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;jobLocation&quot;:{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Place&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@name&quot;: &quot;Meta Digital Labs - Hyderabad Campus&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;address&quot;: {&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;PostalAddress&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;streetAddress&quot;: &quot;507, Ashoka Bhoopal Chambers, Begumpet&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;addressLocality&quot;: &quot;Hyderabad&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;addressRegion&quot;: &quot;TS&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;postalCode&quot;: &quot;500003&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;addressCountry&quot;: &quot;IN&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;}&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;},&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;baseSalary&quot;:{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;MonetaryAmount&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;value&quot;: &quot;:{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;QuantitativeValue&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;380000&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;YEAR&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; }&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; },&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;industry&quot;: &quot;Software Development&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;occupationalCategory&quot;: &quot;Software Engineers&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;applicantLocationRequirements&quot;:{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Country&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; },&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;directApply&quot;: &quot;true&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">// + educating Google and LLMs about where to book or get tickets.</span></span><br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">// and more.</span><br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">// + additional fields we map to work 100% with all possible fields or</span>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">// datapoints your events have.</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;// + we also advise you best strategies and apply our secret sauce on</span>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">// enhancing the power of schema relevant to your site (not just your industry)</span><br><br>&nbsp;&lt;/<span style=\"color:#c18401;background:transparent !important;\">script</span>&gt;&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">This is just an example &mdash; your live implementation uses real titles, descriptions, companies, locations, and salary ranges from your BD data.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">Zero manual work for you.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">Zero ongoing maintenance.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">Maximum SEO + AI impact.</p><hr><h2>How It Helps Your Members (Employers)</h2><ul><li><strong>Better visibility</strong> for each job in Google and AI-powered job experiences</li><li><strong>More qualified applicant</strong>s as search engines understand who the role is for</li><li><strong>Higher trust</strong> with clearly defined employer, salary, and location</li><li><strong>Professional presentation&nbsp;</strong>that makes their listings stand out vs generic boards</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Helps You (Directory Owner)</h2><ul><li>Stronger <strong>SEO &amp; AEO</strong> performance at the individual job level</li><li>More attractive <strong>premium job posting</strong><strong>&nbsp;tiers</strong> (because you can include &ldquo;SEO-ready Job Schema&rdquo; as a benefit)</li><li>Improved consistency across all jobs (even when members write uneven descriptions)</li><li>Zero extra steps for your team after setup &mdash; schema follows your content automatically</li></ul><blockquote><strong>Small Note:</strong> Once your Job Detail schema is in place, it pairs perfectly with<strong>&nbsp;Jobs Results Schem</strong>a for full coverage. And if you ever want help prioritizing schema across other post types, our<strong>&nbsp;SEO Consulting</strong>service can guide you on what to do next based on your goals.</blockquote><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong>Step 1: Click &quot;Order Now&quot; &amp; Share a Few Details</strong></p><p>Tell us your name, email, website URL, and how jobs are currently used on your site.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong>Step 2: Confirm Payment</strong></p><p>Once payment is complete, we queue your Job Detail schema setup.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong>Step 3: Quick Review &amp; Clarifications</strong></p><p>Within 24&ndash;48 hours, we&rsquo;ll reach out only if we need clarification on fields, custom data, or special cases.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong>Step 4: Implementation &amp; Go-Live</strong></p><p>We configure, implement, and validate the schema on your Job Detail pages. You approve, and we push it live.</p><hr><p><strong>Ready for Smarter Job Detail Pages?</strong></p><p>Click <strong>Order Now</strong> to activate refined Job Detail Schema and help every job on your site perform better across Google and AI search.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '15c1484561ff45eb5082359689d8e30f', 'solutions/job-schema-for-job-detail-page', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', '<div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 53.75%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/73e26f05c0f24ac886210db0420e0feb?sid=c1d977d4-5ae5-4bed-aa95-ced234654ea1\" frameborder=\"0\" webkitallowfullscreen mozallowfullscreen allowfullscreen style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe></div>', 'Jobs Schema', 'Jobs Schema', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, 'deposit'),
(610, 101, 'Blog Schema for Blogs Results Page', '<p>Turn every blog post into a clear, AI-understandable knowledge source &mdash; directly from your blog results page.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">Your Blog Results page is not just a list of articles &mdash; it&rsquo;s a <strong>core knowledge surface</strong> that search engines and AI systems analyze to understand:</p><ul><li>what topics your site covers,</li><li>who is publishing the content,</li><li>how fresh and authoritative the information is,</li><li>which posts answer specific questions, and</li><li>how your content should be referenced or summarized by AI.</li></ul><p>Brilliant Directories already outputs <strong>basic list-level schema</strong> (such as <span style=\"font-size:15px !important;background:#ccc !important;padding:3px !important;\">CollectionPage</span> and <span style=\"font-size:15px !important;background:#ccc !important;padding:3px !important;\">ItemList</span>), which is a solid baseline. However, BD cannot infer editorial intent, authorship depth, content relationships, or how your blog content should be interpreted by modern AI systems.</p><p>That&rsquo;s where we step in.</p><p>This service enhances your Blogs Results page with <strong>clean, complete, search-ready JSON-LD Blog</strong> &amp; BlogPosting schema, fully aligned with your BD blog data and compliant with modern SEO + AI consumption standards.</p><p><strong>The result?</strong><br>Google and LLMs can correctly interpret each blog post as a structured content asset &mdash; not just a text link.</p><hr><h2>What This Implemented Schema Does</h2><p>Instead of search engines guessing what each blog post represents, we explicitly describe every visible article using structured <span style=\"font-size:15px !important;background:#ccc !important;padding:3px !important;\">BlogPosting</span> objects.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">Our system automatically:</p><ul><li>Defines the page as a proper <strong>CollectionPage / ItemList</strong></li><li>Lists each visible blog post as a full <strong>BlogPosting</strong> entity</li><li>Maps essential content fields:<ul><li>Post Title</li><li>Post Description / Excerpt</li><li>Author (member or admin)</li><li>Publisher (your directory)</li><li>Publish Date</li><li>Modified Date (when available)</li><li>Main Blog URL</li></ul></li><li>Pulls everything from your <strong>live BD blog&nbsp;</strong><strong>data</strong> &mdash; no manual input</li><li>Works with all themes, layouts, and custom designs</li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">When your directory uses richer blog fields, we also map:</p><ul><li>Featured images</li><li>Article sections or categories</li><li>Tags and topical keywords</li><li>Reading time (when derivable)</li><li>Internal content relationships</li></ul><p>These enhancements are included <strong>automatically</strong> whenever the data exists.</p><p>Your page remains visually unchanged &mdash; the schema operates entirely behind the scenes.</p><blockquote><strong>Note:</strong> This setup covers all critical fields required for blog indexing, featured snippets, and AI content understanding. More advanced editorial or knowledge-graph strategies can be layered later if needed.</blockquote><hr><h2>How It Works (Simple &amp; Automatic)</h2><ol><li>We detect all blog posts currently visible on your results page.</li><li>We extract relevant data directly from BD&rsquo;s blog fields.</li><li>We generate clean, validated JSON-LD BlogPosting schema.</li><li>Search engines and AI systems immediately understand your content structure.</li><li>New or updated blog posts automatically appear in the schema.</li><li>No additional work for authors or admins.</li></ol><hr><h2>Live Example (JSON-LD Preview)</h2><p>Below is a simplified example of the type of schema we implement for your <strong>Blogs Results Page</strong>. Actual implementations dynamically include all available mapped fields.</p><table cellpadding=\"14\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); background: rgb(242, 242, 242); width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-family:Courier,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;\">&nbsp;&lt;<span style=\"color:#c18401;background:transparent !important;\">script type</span>=&quot;application/ld+json&quot;&gt;&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color:#50a14f;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@context&quot;: &quot;https://schema.org&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;ItemList&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Latest Blog Posts&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;itemListElement&quot;: [&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;BlogPosting&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;headline&quot;: &quot;How Local Directories Win in AI Search&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;description&quot;: &quot;A practical guide to optimizing directory blogs for SEO and AI-driven discovery.&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;author&quot;: {&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Person&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Editorial Team&quot;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;publisher&quot;: {&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Organization&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Your Directory Name&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://yourdirectory.com&quot;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;datePublished&quot;: &quot;2025-01-12&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;dateModified&quot;: &quot;2025-01-15&quot;,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://yourdirectory.com/blog/ai-search-for-directories&quot;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;}&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;]&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;} &nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;// + educating Google and LLMs about blog topics, freshness, and authority.&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;// and more.&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;// + additional fields we map automatically when blog data exists&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;// (images, categories, tags, author profiles, etc.)&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;// + we also advise and apply best-practice schema strategies&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#a0a1a7;background:transparent !important;\">&nbsp;// to enhance SEO, AEO, and AI visibility for your directory&nbsp;</span><br>&lt;/<span style=\"color:#c18401;background:transparent !important;\">script</span>&gt;&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>Zero manual work for you.<br>Zero ongoing maintenance.<br>Maximum SEO + AI visibility<strong>.</strong></p><hr><h2>How It Helps Your Members (Employers)</h2><ul><li><strong>Stronger visibility</strong> for every published article</li><li><strong>Clear authorship</strong> recognition in AI systems</li><li><strong>Improved chances</strong> of content appearing in summaries and answers</li><li><strong>Better long-term</strong> <strong>discoverability</strong> of evergreen posts</li></ul><hr><h2>How It Helps You (Directory Owner)</h2><ul><li>Stronger <strong>SEO &amp; AEO</strong>, and content authority signals</li><li>Improved eligibility for rich results and AI citations</li><li>Higher value for premium content or sponsored posts</li><li>No technical setup or maintenance required</li><li>Schema updates automatically as content changes</li></ul><blockquote><strong>Small note:</strong> Once your Blogs Results Schema is live, many directories naturally proceed to add Blog Detail Schema and Author Schema for maximum authority. Our SEO Consulting service can help prioritize these based on your growth goals.</blockquote><hr><h2>🚀 Next Steps</h2><p><strong>Step 1: Click &quot;Order Now&quot; &amp; Submit a Few Details</strong><br>Share your name, email, and website URL.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Complete Payment to Confirm</strong><br>Your blog schema setup is queued immediately after payment.</p><p><strong>Step 3: We Review &amp; Validate</strong><br>We reach out only if clarification is required.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Implementation Goes Live</strong><br>Schemas are generated, validated, approved, and activated.</p><hr><h2>Ready for Smarter Content Visibility?</h2><p>Click <strong>Order Now</strong> to activate structured Blog Schema on your Blogs Results Page and unlock stronger visibility across Google and AI-powered search.</p>', NULL, NULL, '20260613033221', '', 0, '6197b684d65545733a6c3bb534148a69', 'solutions/blog-schema-for-blogs-results-page', 1, 0, '', ' ', '', 4, 83, 'Enhance Conversions', '2026-06-13 07:35:44', '', '', '', ' ', '', '', '', '', 250.00, 0.00, 0.0, 0.0, NULL, 0, '', '0000-00-00', '', '', 0, NULL, 'fixed_price', 'quick_service', '', '', ' ', '12_weeks', ' ', ' ', ' ', 'Blog Schema', 'Blog Schema', 'semi_custom', ' ', 0.00, ' ');

--
-- Triggers `users_portfolio_groups`
--
DELIMITER $$
CREATE TRIGGER `trg_users_portfolio_groups_delete_tools` AFTER DELETE ON `users_portfolio_groups` FOR EACH ROW BEGIN
  DECLARE v_tool_identifier VARCHAR(50);
  
  SET v_tool_identifier = CONCAT('#', OLD.group_id);
  
  -- Soft delete: Set status to archived
  UPDATE bdgs_tools
  SET status = 'archived',
      updated_at = NOW()
  WHERE tool_identifier = v_tool_identifier;
END
$$
DELIMITER ;
DELIMITER $$
CREATE TRIGGER `trg_users_portfolio_groups_insert_tools` AFTER INSERT ON `users_portfolio_groups` FOR EACH ROW BEGIN
  DECLARE v_data_name VARCHAR(255);
  DECLARE v_tool_identifier VARCHAR(50);
  DECLARE v_tool_slug VARCHAR(255);
  DECLARE v_post_type_id INT;
  DECLARE v_impl_type_id INT;
  DECLARE v_warranty_type_id INT;
  DECLARE v_delivery_time_id INT;
  DECLARE v_status ENUM('active', 'inactive', 'archived');
  
  -- Check if this is a Tools post (data_id = 72 or data_name = 'Tools')
  SELECT data_name INTO v_data_name
  FROM data_categories
  WHERE data_id = NEW.data_id
  LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_data_name = 'Tools' AND NEW.group_name IS NOT NULL AND NEW.group_name != '' THEN
    -- Generate tool identifier and slug
    SET v_tool_identifier = CONCAT('#', NEW.group_id);
    SET v_tool_slug = generate_tool_slug(NEW.group_name);
    
    -- Ensure slug is unique
    WHILE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM bdgs_tools WHERE tool_slug = v_tool_slug) DO
      SET v_tool_slug = CONCAT(v_tool_slug, '-', NEW.group_id);
    END WHILE;
    
    -- Get lookup IDs
    SET v_post_type_id = get_post_type_id(NEW.group_category);
    SET v_impl_type_id = get_implementation_type_id(NEW.implementation_type);
    SET v_warranty_type_id = get_warranty_type_id(NEW.warranty_time_title);
    SET v_delivery_time_id = get_delivery_time_id(NEW.delivery_time_description);
    
    -- Set status
    SET v_status = CASE WHEN NEW.group_status = 1 THEN 'active' ELSE 'inactive' END;
    
    -- Insert into bdgs_tools
    INSERT INTO bdgs_tools (
      tool_identifier,
      tool_name,
      tool_slug,
      description,
      post_type_id,
      implementation_type_id,
      warranty_type_id,
      delivery_time_id,
      display_order,
      status,
      created_at
    ) VALUES (
      v_tool_identifier,
      NEW.group_name,
      v_tool_slug,
      NEW.group_desc,
      v_post_type_id,
      v_impl_type_id,
      v_warranty_type_id,
      v_delivery_time_id,
      NEW.group_order,
      v_status,
      COALESCE(NEW.group_date, NOW())
    )
    ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
      tool_name = NEW.group_name,
      tool_slug = v_tool_slug,
      description = NEW.group_desc,
      post_type_id = v_post_type_id,
      implementation_type_id = v_impl_type_id,
      warranty_type_id = v_warranty_type_id,
      delivery_time_id = v_delivery_time_id,
      display_order = NEW.group_order,
      status = v_status,
      updated_at = NOW();
  END IF;
END
$$
DELIMITER ;
DELIMITER $$
CREATE TRIGGER `trg_users_portfolio_groups_update_tools` AFTER UPDATE ON `users_portfolio_groups` FOR EACH ROW BEGIN
  DECLARE v_data_name VARCHAR(255);
  DECLARE v_tool_identifier VARCHAR(50);
  DECLARE v_tool_slug VARCHAR(255);
  DECLARE v_post_type_id INT;
  DECLARE v_impl_type_id INT;
  DECLARE v_warranty_type_id INT;
  DECLARE v_delivery_time_id INT;
  DECLARE v_status ENUM('active', 'inactive', 'archived');
  
  -- Check if this is a Tools post
  SELECT data_name INTO v_data_name
  FROM data_categories
  WHERE data_id = NEW.data_id
  LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_data_name = 'Tools' AND NEW.group_name IS NOT NULL AND NEW.group_name != '' THEN
    SET v_tool_identifier = CONCAT('#', NEW.group_id);
    SET v_tool_slug = generate_tool_slug(NEW.group_name);
    
    -- Ensure slug is unique (excluding current tool)
    WHILE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM bdgs_tools WHERE tool_slug = v_tool_slug AND tool_identifier != v_tool_identifier) DO
      SET v_tool_slug = CONCAT(v_tool_slug, '-', NEW.group_id);
    END WHILE;
    
    -- Get lookup IDs
    SET v_post_type_id = get_post_type_id(NEW.group_category);
    SET v_impl_type_id = get_implementation_type_id(NEW.implementation_type);
    SET v_warranty_type_id = get_warranty_type_id(NEW.warranty_time_title);
    SET v_delivery_time_id = get_delivery_time_id(NEW.delivery_time_description);
    
    SET v_status = CASE WHEN NEW.group_status = 1 THEN 'active' ELSE 'inactive' END;
    
    -- Update or insert
    INSERT INTO bdgs_tools (
      tool_identifier,
      tool_name,
      tool_slug,
      description,
      post_type_id,
      implementation_type_id,
      warranty_type_id,
      delivery_time_id,
      display_order,
      status,
      created_at,
      updated_at
    ) VALUES (
      v_tool_identifier,
      NEW.group_name,
      v_tool_slug,
      NEW.group_desc,
      v_post_type_id,
      v_impl_type_id,
      v_warranty_type_id,
      v_delivery_time_id,
      NEW.group_order,
      v_status,
      COALESCE(NEW.group_date, NOW()),
      NOW()
    )
    ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
      tool_name = NEW.group_name,
      tool_slug = v_tool_slug,
      description = NEW.group_desc,
      post_type_id = v_post_type_id,
      implementation_type_id = v_impl_type_id,
      warranty_type_id = v_warranty_type_id,
      delivery_time_id = v_delivery_time_id,
      display_order = NEW.group_order,
      status = v_status,
      updated_at = NOW();
  END IF;
END
$$
DELIMITER ;

